orie 1"}},"value":32}],"date_exceptions":[],"closing_days":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"accessibilities":[],"recurring":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["exterior"]},{"id":479991,"date_start":"2023-02-13","date_end":"2024-07-31","date_next":"2024-02-21","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":true,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-02-17T01:04:41+01:00","published_at":"2019-08-09T13:38:27+02:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":199991,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"other","ranking":0.12318242212339181,"languages":{"spoken":["fr","nl","en"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":90,"translations":{"de":"Animationen","pt":null,"en":"Animations","it":"Animazioni","cn":null,"fr":"Animations","sp":"Animaciones","nl":"Animaties"}},"others":{"list":[99],"translations":{"de":["Gastronomie"],"pt":[null],"en":["Gastronomy"],"it":["Cucina"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Gastronomie"],"sp":["Gastronom\u00eda"],"nl":["Gastronomie"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Discover Belgium's beer world","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/beersecret.com\/tour\/brussels-beer-beyond-tour\/","email":"hello@beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":"+32 472 60 47 46","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"pt":{"name":"Discover Belgium's beer world","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/beersecret.com\/tour\/brussels-beer-beyond-tour\/","email":"hello@beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":"+32 472 60 47 46","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"en":{"name":"Discover Brussels' beer world with a passionate young local incl. a chocolate pairing","shortdescr":"Visit a craft brewery \r\nTaste 5 high quality beers \r\nStorytelling of the local prestige: from the Lambic source to the Zennepils\r\nExplore hidden places like a historic site that will transform into a brewery\r\nLearn about the history of Belgium\u2019s Trappist, Lambic and other traditional brews\r\nDiscover the real taste of hops and malts\r\nGet inspiration for new destinations in Belgium","longdescr":"As we make our way to the first brewery, we\u2019ll pass by your guide\u2019s favorite beer shop to find out how familiar you are with the Belgian and local beer portfolio.\r\n\r\nOur first stop will be at our hidden gem inspired with medieval atmosphere. Here, sample your first beer and exchange thoughts on the flavor and notes and soak up the convivial spirit as you chat to your group. If you don\u2019t know the difference between an ale and a lager, listen carefully cause your guide is about to share the secrets of the brewing process. At every venue, we\u2019ll surprise you by combining our beers with some local food to make sure you enjoy the full Belgian beer-and-food experience. So now it\u2019s time to enjoy that delicious Brussels\u2019 chocolate your guide has put on the table for you. \r\n\r\nIt\u2019s time to move on to another lively beer spot. The knowledge of Liselot is more than only about beers: as a proud citizen, she\u2019ll share fascinating novels about Brussels Belfry, Manneken Pis and the historical Pelgrim church. Your sightseeing will be completed with a walking encyclopedia. \r\n\r\nAt our second location, we\u2019ll discover more different styles and further explore the world-famous Belgian brew portfolio. By tasting the very ingredients that make up the brewing process, you\u2019ll feel like you\u2019re visiting a brewery and you\u2019ll get a sense of what makes a beer sour, sweet or bitter. Now, have you ever tried unique Belgian types like Trappists and our local Brussels brews? Make sure your taste buds are ready cause you are about to be introduced to the widest range of Belgian beers you have ever seen in just one bar. This visit will be completed with another surprising local food pairing.\r\n\r\nFor our second promenade, Liselot demonstrates how Brussels got this fertiled environment to make Lambic beers. Only a few metres further, you\u2019ll hear more history of the old city wall and a recognised statue. \r\n\r\nLast but not least, at your 3rd location you\u2019 ll be introduced to the upscaling local craft beer market and will get the chance to try an exclusive beer you can only find in this town. Have you found your new favourite beer? Explore variants of it and make the most of these last moments together!\r\n\r\nAfter 3 hours, your tour will come to a close in the nicest area of town where you will be free to spend time with your new friends or to continue this unique beer experience. ","performers":"Liselot Caura and\/or colleagues ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/beersecret.com\/tour\/brussels-beer-beyond-tour\/","email":"hello@beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":"+32 472 60 47 46","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"it":{"name":"Discover Belgium's beer world","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/beersecret.com\/tour\/brussels-beer-beyond-tour\/","email":"hello@beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":"+32 472 60 47 46","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"cn":{"name":"Discover Belgium's beer world","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/beersecret.com\/tour\/brussels-beer-beyond-tour\/","email":"hello@beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":"+32 472 60 47 46","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"fr":{"name":"Tour de bi\u00e8re avec une guide passion\u00e9e incl. une association de mets de chocolat","shortdescr":"Visitez une brasserie \r\nD\u00e9gustez 5 bi\u00e8res de haute qualit\u00e9 qui repr\u00e9sente Belgique et Bruxelles\r\nD\u00e9couvrez l'histoire de la trappiste belge, du lambic et d'autres brassins traditionnels\r\nD\u00e9couvrez le vrai go\u00fbt du houblon et des malts \r\nExplorez des lieux cach\u00e9s tels qu'un site historique qui sera bient\u00f4t transform\u00e9 en brasserie\r\nInspirez-vous des futures destinations comme Gand et Bruges","longdescr":"Rencontrez votre guide et un petit groupe de 15 personnes maximum dans le centre de Bruxelles et partez \u00e0 l'aventure pour une d\u00e9gustation de bi\u00e8re de 3 heures.\r\n\r\nEn route vers le premier bar, nous passerons par le magasin de bi\u00e8re pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9 de votre guide pour d\u00e9couvrir \u00e0 quel point vous connaissez le portefeuille de bi\u00e8res belges et locales.\r\n\r\nNotre premier arr\u00eat sera \u00e0 notre joyau cach\u00e9 inspir\u00e9 de l'atmosph\u00e8re m\u00e9di\u00e9vale. Vous pourrez y d\u00e9guster votre premi\u00e8re bi\u00e8re, \u00e9changer des id\u00e9es sur les saveurs et les notes et vous impr\u00e9gner de l'esprit convivial en discutant avec votre groupe. Si vous ne connaissez pas la diff\u00e9rence entre une ale et une lager, \u00e9coutez attentivement car votre guide est sur le point de vous d\u00e9voiler les secrets du processus de brassage. Dans tous les lieux, nous vous surprendrons en combinant nos bi\u00e8res avec des produits locaux pour vous faire vivre pleinement l'exp\u00e9rience de la bi\u00e8re et de la nourriture belges. Il est donc temps maintenant de savourer le d\u00e9licieux chocolat de Bruxelles que votre guide a mis sur la table pour vous. \r\n\r\nIl est temps de passer \u00e0 un autre endroit anim\u00e9, celui de la bi\u00e8re. Les connaissances de Liselot ne se limitent pas aux bi\u00e8res : en tant que fi\u00e8re citoyenne, elle vous fera d\u00e9couvrir des romans fascinants sur le Beffroi de Bruxelles, le Manneken Pis et l'\u00e9glise historique de Pelgrim. Votre visite sera compl\u00e9t\u00e9e par une encyclop\u00e9die vivante. \r\n\r\nDans notre deuxi\u00e8me stop, nous d\u00e9couvrirons d'autres styles et nous explorerons plus avant le portefeuille de brasseries belges de renomm\u00e9e mondiale. En d\u00e9gustant les ingr\u00e9dients m\u00eames qui composent le processus de brassage, vous aurez l'impression de visiter une brasserie et vous aurez une id\u00e9e de ce qui rend une bi\u00e8re aigre, douce ou am\u00e8re. Avez-vous d\u00e9j\u00e0 go\u00fbt\u00e9 \u00e0 des bi\u00e8res belges uniques comme les trappistes ou celles de nos brasseries locales de Bruxelles ? Assurez-vous que vos papilles soient pr\u00eates, car vous \u00eates sur le point de d\u00e9couvrir la plus vaste gamme de bi\u00e8res belge que vous n\u2019ayez jamais vu dans un seul bar. Cette visite sera compl\u00e9t\u00e9e par un autre accord surprenant avec de la cuisine locale.\r\n\r\nEnfin, \u00e0 votre troisi\u00e8me emplacement, vous d\u00e9couvrirez le march\u00e9 local de la bi\u00e8re artisanale, qui conna\u00eet une grande expansion, et vous aurez la possibilit\u00e9 dego\u00fbter \u00e0 une bi\u00e8re exclusive que vous ne trouverez que dans cette ville. Avez-vous trouv\u00e9 votre nouvelle bi\u00e8re pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9e ? Explorez ses variantes et profitez ensemble de ces derniers moments !\r\n\r\nApr\u00e8s 3 heures, votre visite se terminera dans le plus beau quartier de la ville o\u00f9 vous serez libre de passer du temps avec vos nouveaux amis ou de poursuivre cette exp\u00e9rience unique de la bi\u00e8re . ","performers":"Liselot Caura et\/ou des coll\u00e8gues","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/beersecret.com\/tour\/brussels-beer-beyond-tour\/","email":"hello@beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":"+32 472 60 47 46","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"sp":{"name":"Discover Belgium's beer world","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/beersecret.com\/tour\/brussels-beer-beyond-tour\/","email":"hello@beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":"+32 472 60 47 46","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"},"nl":{"name":"Ontdek de Brusselse bierwereld met een gepassioneerde local incl een chocolade pairing","shortdescr":"Bezoek \u00e9\u00e9n brouwerij \r\nProef 5 degustaties: van traditioneel tot lokale craft\r\nAnekdotes over de lokale prestige: van de Lambiek oorsprong tot de Zennepils\r\nOntdek in primeur een toekomstige craft brouwerij\r\nLeer alles over de traditie, geschiedenis en oorsprong van bier\r\nOntdek de echte smaak van hop en mout\r\nDoe inspiratie op voor nieuwe vakantiebestemmingen binnen Belgi\u00eb","longdescr":"Belgi\u00eb heeft een trotse brouwerstraditie. Al wandelend naar onze eerste locatie onthult Liselot enthousiast alvast wat van de biergeheimen achter het brede Belgische aanbod gerstenat. We maken meteen ook een kleine tussenstop in de favoriete bierwinkel van de gids zodat je je persoonlijke favoriete bieren kan aanwijzen. Zo kunnen we tijdens de bierproeverij rekening houden met je voorkeuren, maar vooral ook nieuwe smaken en verrassende aroma\u2019s aanbrengen.\r\n\r\nDe eerste stop is steeds op \u00e9\u00e9n van de verborgen pareltjes met een middeleeuwse sfeer als achtergrond. Een bierplek die zelfs voor de meeste locals onbekend is. We vliegen er meteen in en proeven ons eerste biertje. Liselot doet er alles aan om het bierbrouwproces van A tot Z uit de doeken te doen, zodat jij alle kennis over bier kan opslorpen op je eigen tempo.Je gids is extreem gepassioneerd en gaat zo op in de interessante biergeheimen, waardoor je haar zeker mag helpen onthouden om de tweede bierdegustatie te starten. Deze proeverij zullen we niet voorbij laten gaan zonder een smakelijke foodpairing. Keek je al reikhalzend uit naar de wereldbekende Belgische chocolade? Dan mag je nu eindelijk proeven van overheerlijke Brusselse chocolade pralines. Wist je dat bier en chocolade verrassend goed samengaat? \r\n\r\nTijd om meer plaatsen te ontdekken. Liselot haar kennis is niet beperkt tot bier: als een trotse Brusselaar, deelt ze graag enkele geheimen over het Belfort, Manneken Pis en de historische Pelgrimse kerk. \r\n\r\nDe volgende bestemming is al even indrukwekkend \u00e9n exclusief. De bars die we samen bezoeken gaan van trendy en modern tot middeleeuws en traditioneel. Voor elk wat wils om in zijn of haar ideale setting bier te proeven. Hier schenken we een heerlijk traditioneel aanbod om te degusteren: een ambachtelijke Trappist en een Brusselse Lambiek mogen niet ontbreken, twee bieren die je de ultieme smaak laat proeven van de typische Belgische bierwereld. Luister tijdens de bierproeverij vooral goed naar de levendige verhalen en anekdotes die Liselot je vertelt over de middeleeuwse paters die in hun abdijen ijverig bier brouwden en daarmee in de 20e eeuw Belgi\u00eb als bierland op de kaart hebben gezet. Dit bezoek wordt verrijkt met een nieuwe foodpairing.\r\n\r\nTijdens onze tweede wandeling heeft Liselot geen schrik om jullie te demonstreren aan wat Brussel deze vruchtbare omgeving heeft te danken. \r\n\r\nHet laatste caf\u00e9 past perfect in het rijtje van levendige en geliefde bierspots. De ideale plek om onze tour te be\u00ebindigen, want van hieruit kan je nog heel wat andere traditionele en moderne plekken ontdekken.\r\n\r\nNa de bierproeverij geeft onze gids Liselot je nog een paar laatste aanbevelingen mee op basis van je nieuwe favoriete bier, zodat je gewoon door kunt gaan met barhoppen. Geniet ervan ! ","performers":"Liselot Caura en\/of collega's ","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/beersecret.com\/tour\/brussels-beer-beyond-tour\/","email":"hello@beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":"+32 472 60 47 46","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.479991"}},"place":{"id":266754,"translations":{"de":{"name":"BeerSecret","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"188","address_street_box":null,"email":"liselot@creatiefcaura.com","website":"http:\/\/www.beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Antoine Dansaert, 188","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"BeerSecret","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"188","address_street_box":null,"email":"liselot@creatiefcaura.com","website":"http:\/\/www.beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Antoine Dansaert, 188","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"BeerSecret","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"188","address_street_box":null,"email":"liselot@creatiefcaura.com","website":"http:\/\/www.beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Antoine Dansaert, 188","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"BeerSecret was founded in 2016 by Liselot Caura, a young lady in her thirties, who has passion for beer & entertainment. \nDuring the last decade, the number of Belgian breweries has quadrupled. Beer lovers are often lost when they have to choose from a wide selection of Belgian beers. BeerSecret is your guide in this rich Belgian beer culture by organising beer & brewery tours in Ghent, Brussels & Bruges. Their tours are hosted by local and passionate beer guides, given with a personal approach. That makes them so unique. You can join one of the weekly shared group tours, or ask for a private tour with a guaranteed customised beer selection and storytelling.    ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"BeerSecret","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"188","address_street_box":null,"email":"liselot@creatiefcaura.com","website":"http:\/\/www.beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Antoine Dansaert, 188","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"BeerSecret","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"188","address_street_box":null,"email":"liselot@creatiefcaura.com","website":"http:\/\/www.beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Antoine Dansaert, 188","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"BeerSecret","address_street_name":"Rue Antoine Dansaert","address_street_number":"188","address_street_box":null,"email":"liselot@creatiefcaura.com","website":"http:\/\/www.beersecret.com","phone_contact":"+32 472 60 47 46","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Antoine Dansaert