he program includes 40 stands, bars and food trucks with South American flavours, as well as concerts, DJ sets, strolling shows and a host of caliente activities to immerse you in a festive Latino atmosphere over the two days of the festival!\n\nAs with last year's festival, you'll have the chance to take part in colorful parades, immersing you in the carnival world and the folklore of Latin American countries through wild dances, extravagant costumes, titanic floats and much more!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005777"},"it":{"name":"Fiesta Latina Carnival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005777"},"cn":{"name":"Fiesta Latina Carnival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005777"},"fr":{"name":"Fiesta Latina Carnival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"Pour la deuxi\u00e8me ann\u00e9e cons\u00e9cutive, la Fiesta Latina revient avec son \u00e9dition Carnival. Cette ann\u00e9e encore, on vous emm\u00e8ne pendant 2 jours au c\u0153ur des traditions carnavalesques les plus c\u00e9l\u00e8bres d\u2019Am\u00e9rique Latine!\n\nAu programme, vous retrouverez 40 stands, bars et food trucks aux saveurs sud-am\u00e9ricaines ainsi que des concerts, DJ sets, spectacles ambulants et multiples activit\u00e9s caliente qui vous plongeront dans une ambiance latino et festive au court des deux journ\u00e9es de festival!\n\nTout comme pour l\u2019\u00e9dition pr\u00e9c\u00e9dente, vous aurez la chance de d\u00e9couvrir des parades de folie hautes en couleurs, pour vous immerger dans le monde carnavalesque et le folklore des pays d\u2019Am\u00e9rique latine \u00e0 travers des danses endiabl\u00e9es, des costumes extravagants, des chars titanesques, et bien d\u2019autres encore!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005777"},"sp":{"name":"Fiesta Latina Carnival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005777"},"nl":{"name":"Fiesta Latina Carnival","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":"De Fiesta Latina komt dit jaar opnieuw met zijn Carnival-editie. Ook dit jaar nemen we je gedurende 2 dagen mee naar het hart van de meest beroemde carnavalstradities in Latijns-Amerika!\n\nOp het programma staan 40 stands, bars en foodtrucks met Zuid-Amerikaanse smaken, evenals concerten, DJ-sets, rondtrekkende shows en tal van opwindende activiteiten die je onderdompelen in een Latijns en feestelijke sfeer gedurende de twee festivaldagen!\n\nNet als bij de vorige editie krijg je de kans om waanzinnige, kleurrijke parades te ontdekken die je onderdompelen in de wereld van carnaval en folklore uit Latijns-Amerika met razende dansen, extravagante kostuums, reusachtige praalwagens en nog veel meer!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fiesta-latina.be\/","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005777"}},"place":{"id":50001011,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Tour & Taxis - Sheds 1 & 1bis","address_street_name":"Avenue du Port","address_street_number":"88","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website"