:{"name":"Normal"},"it":{"name":"Normale"},"fr":{"name":"Normal"},"sp":{"name":"Normal"},"nl":{"name":"Normaal"}},"value":17},{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Senioren"},"en":{"name":"Seniors"},"it":{"name":"Anziani"},"fr":{"name":"Seniors"},"sp":{"name":"Mayores"},"nl":{"name":"Senioren"}},"value":15},{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Arbeitsuchende"},"en":{"name":"Job seekers"},"it":{"name":"Disoccupati"},"fr":{"name":"Demandeurs d'emploi"},"sp":{"name":"Desempleados"},"nl":{"name":"Werkzoekenden"}},"value":10},{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Jugendliche"},"en":{"name":"Youth"},"it":{"name":"Ragazzi"},"fr":{"name":"Jeunes"},"sp":{"name":"J\u00f3venes"},"nl":{"name":"Jongeren"}},"value":10},{"translations":{"de":{"name":"Article 27"},"pt":{"name":"Article 27"},"en":{"name":"Article 27"},"it":{"name":"Article 27"},"cn":{"name":"Article 27"},"fr":{"name":"Article 27"},"sp":{"name":"Article 27"},"nl":{"name":"Artikel 27"}},"value":1.25}],"date_exceptions":[],"closing_days":[],"child_events":[],"parent_events":[],"accessibilities":[],"recurring":[],"targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":[]},{"id":50006987,"date_start":"2024-02-24","date_end":"2024-02-24","date_next":"2024-02-24","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":false,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-02-07T12:45:02+01:00","published_at":"2024-02-07T12:44:11+01:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":294033,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"concert","ranking":1.2599210498948732,"languages":{"spoken":["nl","en","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"de":"Konzert","pt":null,"en":"Concert","it":"Concerti","cn":null,"fr":"Concert","sp":"Concierto","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Polytopie w\/ Ossia + Raja + u.ly + Terrine","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/fr\/agenda\/polytopie","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006987"},"pt":{"name":"Polytopie w\/ Ossia + Raja + u.ly + Terrine","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/fr\/agenda\/polytopie","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006987"},"en":{"name":"Polytopie w\/ Ossia + Raja + u.ly + Terrine","shortdescr":"Join us in celebrating POLYTOPIE #3 in our beloved Recyclart. We've decided to offer a slightly different format so that you can enjoy the cloudy dubby atmosphere that will reign this afternoon before shaking your feet and your head as the night falls. From Bristol to Marseille through Amiens and Bx, they\u21e3 will bring us into an another dubby-bassy-noisy level ! \n","longdescr":"\u21e2 POLYTOPIE #3 \u21e0\n \nJoin us in celebrating POLYTOPIE #3 in our beloved Recyclart. We've decided to offer a slightly different format so that you can enjoy the cloudy dubby atmosphere that will reign this afternoon before shaking your feet and your head as the night falls. From Bristol to Marseille through Amiens and Bx, they\u21e3 will bring us into an another dubby-bassy-noisy level ! \n__________________________________\n \n\u2727 OSSIA (Young Echo)\n\nOssia's sound world is an amalgamation of heavy-weather, beyond-good-and-evil soundsystem poetics, channelling raw and rootical techno, isolationist abstraction, and dub at its most turbulent and raw-nerved and space-time-warping. Bristol born, now Brussel bassed, ready to woob-woob.\n \n\u2727 TERRINE [live] (Bruit Direct)\n\nClaire Gapenne, an artist and musician, performs in Terrine and in the duo Me Donner. Passionate about the arts, she has been part of the experimental scene since 2012, notably in the industrial rock band Headwar with whom she discovered other ways of performing music. Within the Amiens\u2019 venue Accueil Froid, she also develops new projects and organises concerts. Born in 2013, her solo project Terrine develops spontaneous and immediate music.\n \n\u2727 RAJA (Ruffcast)\n\nDerived from the low frequencies of reggae dub and Afro-Caribbean influences, Raja has carved his path through the electronic spectrum, from dubstep to the broader hardcore continuum. A member of the Lille-based Ruffcast crew since 2015, he adeptly juggles dubstep, breaks, jungle, and anything related to UK Soundsystem culture. An eclectic passion for hybrid sounds, shaped by his Afro-descendant identity, defines his style behind the turntables.\n\n \n\u2727 U.LY b2b DON CHAR (Garage 83c x Polytope)\n\nThe feisty decks-girl stamped 83-C turns on the club's suspension . Bouncy-festive music, happy hardtrance, distro-hyperpop & glitter ! She will be accompanied by our wonderkid, the mischievous Don Char.\n\n \n\u2727 POLYTOPE DJ'S","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/fr\/agenda\/polytopie","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006987"},"it":{"name":"Polytopie w\/ Ossia + Raja + u.ly + Terrine","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/fr\/agenda\/polytopie","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006987"},"cn":{"name":"Polytopie w\/ Ossia + Raja + u.ly + Terrine","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/fr\/agenda\/polytopie","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006987"},"fr":{"name":"Polytopie w\/ Ossia + Raja + u.ly + Terrine","shortdescr":"Polytope prend d'assaut le Recyclart. Sortez vos meilleurs capuchons et venez profiter de cette courte clart\u00e9 hivernale pour danser et vous r\u00e9chauffer sur des sons caverneux et rebondissants. Au menu : des DJ sets avec Ossia, figure de la dub\/bass de Bristol, Raja, r\u00e9sident de Ruffcast, u.ly talent local, et un live de Terrine, artiste ami\u00e9noise sign\u00e9e sur Thirty Type Tapes.","longdescr":"\u2727 OSSIA (Young Echo)\n\nOssia's sound world is an amalgamation of heavy-weather, beyond-good-and-evil soundsystem poetics, channelling raw and rootical techno, isolationist abstraction, and dub at its most turbulent and raw-nerved and space-time-warping. Bristol born, now Brussel bassed, ready to woob-woob.\n \n\u2727 TERRINE [live] (Bruit Direct)\n\nClaire Gapenne, an artist and musician, performs in Terrine and in the duo Me Donner. Passionate about the arts, she has been part of the experimental scene since 2012, notably in the industrial rock band Headwar with whom she discovered other ways of performing music. Within the Amiens\u2019 venue Accueil Froid, she also develops new projects and organises concerts. Born in 2013, her solo project Terrine develops spontaneous and immediate music.\n \n\u2727 RAJA (Ruffcast)\n\nDerived from the low frequencies of reggae dub and Afro-Caribbean influences, Raja has carved his path through the electronic spectrum, from dubstep to the broader hardcore continuum. A member of the Lille-based Ruffcast crew since 2015, he adeptly juggles dubstep, breaks, jungle, and anything related to UK Soundsystem culture. An eclectic passion for hybrid sounds, shaped by his Afro-descendant identity, defines his style behind the turntables.\n\n \n\u2727 U.LY b2b DON CHAR (Garage 83c x Polytope)\n\nThe feisty decks-girl stamped 83-C turns on the club's suspension . Bouncy-festive music, happy hardtrance, distro-hyperpop & glitter ! She will be accompanied by our wonderkid, the mischievous Don Char.\n\n \n\u2727 POLYTOPE DJ'S\n ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/fr\/agenda\/polytopie","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006987"},"sp":{"name":"Polytopie w\/ Ossia + Raja + u.ly + Terrine","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/fr\/agenda\/polytopie","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006987"},"nl":{"name":"Polytopie w\/ Ossia + Raja + u.ly + Terrine","shortdescr":"Polytope neemt Recyclart over. Haal je beste hoodies tevoorschijn en kom genieten van deze korte winterse klaarte om te dansen en je op te warmen op diepe en stuiterende klanken. Op het menu: DJ-sets van Ossia, een figuur uit de Bristolse dub\/bass-scene, Raja, resident van Ruffcast, lokaal talent u.ly, en een live-optreden van Terrine.","longdescr":"\u21e2 POLYTOPIE #3 \u21e0\n \nJoin us in celebrating POLYTOPIE #3 in our beloved Recyclart. We've decided to offer a slightly different format so that you can enjoy the cloudy dubby atmosphere that will reign this afternoon before shaking your feet and your head as the night falls. From Bristol to Marseille through Amiens and Bx, they\u21e3 will bring us into an another dubby-bassy-noisy level ! \n__________________________________\n \n\u2727 OSSIA (Young Echo)\n\nOssia's sound world is an amalgamation of heavy-weather, beyond-good-and-evil soundsystem poetics, channelling raw and rootical techno, isolationist abstraction, and dub at its most turbulent and raw-nerved and space-time-warping. Bristol born, now Brussel bassed, ready to woob-woob.\n \n\u2727 TERRINE [live] (Bruit Direct)\n\nClaire Gapenne, an artist and musician, performs in Terrine and in the duo Me Donner. Passionate about the arts, she has been part of the experimental scene since 2012, notably in the industrial rock band Headwar with whom she discovered other ways of performing music. Within the Amiens\u2019 venue Accueil Froid, she also develops new projects and organises concerts. Born in 2013, her solo project Terrine develops spontaneous and immediate music.\n \n\u2727 RAJA (Ruffcast)\n\nDerived from the low frequencies of reggae dub and Afro-Caribbean influences, Raja has carved his path through the electronic spectrum, from dubstep to the broader hardcore continuum. A member of the Lille-based Ruffcast crew since 2015, he adeptly juggles dubstep, breaks, jungle, and anything related to UK Soundsystem culture. An eclectic passion for hybrid sounds, shaped by his Afro-descendant identity, defines his style behind the turntables.\n\n \n\u2727 U.LY b2b DON CHAR (Garage 83c x Polytope)\n\nThe feisty decks-girl stamped 83-C turns on the club's suspension . Bouncy-festive music, happy hardtrance, distro-hyperpop & glitter ! She will be accompanied by our wonderkid, the mischievous Don Char.\n\n \n\u2727 POLYTOPE DJ'S","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/fr\/agenda\/polytopie","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006987"}},"place":{"id":231699,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Die alternative Kunst-, Kultur- und Stadtteilinitiative Recyclart betreibt einen der dynamischsten Orte der Stadt. Zwischen Kunst und gesellschaftlichen Themen bietet Recyclart eine bunte und eklektische Vielfalt an Veranstaltungen und Initiativen. Und seit dem Standortwechsel von dem stillgelegten Bahnhof Bruxelles-Chapelle in ein sch\u00f6nes Geb\u00e4ude mit charmanter Terrasse in einem fast schon Berlinerisch anmutenden Innenhof weht seit 2018 abermals ein frischer Wind. Das Projekt f\u00e4chert sich in drei Bereiche auf: Ein Kunstzentrum, die Bar Recyclart (Bar und Restaurant) und die Recyclart Fabrik (Infra-\/Holz-\/Metallwerkst\u00e4tten) mit Wiedereingliederungsma\u00dfnahmen f\u00fcr Langzeitarbeitslose.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Created in 2000 and now located in Molenbeek since 2018, Recyclart is a multidisciplinary urban project that draws inspiration from the city and its district. A landmark in the history of underground culture in Brussels, it is composed of an ARTS CENTRE and two socio-professional integration projects, namely the RECYCLART BAR and the RECYCLART FABRIK (infra\/wood\/metal workshops).\r\n\r\nAs an art centre, Recyclart connects art to the urban context in which it is embedded. This context acts as a source of inspiration for the artistic activities and, conversely, Recyclart also uses its artistic programme as a catalyst to open up this same urban context and make it more liveable. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Cr\u00e9\u00e9 en 2000 et relocalis\u00e9 depuis 2018 \u00e0 Molenbeek, Recyclart est un projet urbain pluridisciplinaire qui s'inspire de la ville et de son quartier. Haut lieu de l\u2019histoire de la culture underground \u00e0 Bruxelles, il se compose d\u2019un CENTRE D\u2019ARTS et de deux projets d\u2019insertion socioprofessionnelle que sont le BAR RECYCLART et le RECYCLART FABRIK (ateliers infra\/bois\/m\u00e9tal).\r\n\r\nEn tant que centre artistique, Recyclart relie l'art au contexte urbain dans lequel il s'inscrit. Ce contexte sert de source d'inspiration pour les activit\u00e9s artistiques et, inversement, Recyclart utilise \u00e9galement son programme artistique comme un catalyseur pour ouvrir ce m\u00eame contexte urbain et le rendre plus vivable. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"Manchesterstraat ","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Manchesterstraat , 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Het multidisciplinaire stadsproject Recyclart bestaat sinds 2000 en verhuisde in 2018 naar Molenbeek, waar het zich blijft inspireren op de stad en de wijk.  Als een van de belangrijkste plekken in de Brusselse underground-geschiedenis combineert het een KUNSTENCENTRUM met twee sociale integratieprojecten, BAR RECYCLART en RECYCLART FABRIK (werkplaats voor hout-, metaal- en infrastructuurwerk).\r\n\r\nMet het kunstencentrum verbindt Recyclart kunst met de stedelijke context waar het deel van uitmaakt. De stad dient als inspiratiebron voor de artistieke activiteiten, maar ook omgekeerd zet Recyclart haar artistieke programma in als katalysator, om zo diezelfde stedelijke context toegankelijker en leefbaarder te maken.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[8],"translations":{"de":["Kanal-Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Canal"],"it":["Canal"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Canal"],"sp":["Canal"],"nl":["Kanaalwijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[23],"translations":{"de":["Westen"],"pt":[null],"en":["West"],"it":["Ovest"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Ouest"],"sp":["Oeste"],"nl":["West"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":"RECYCLARTBXL","backoffice_id":973,"location":{"lat":50.84757339,"lon":4.32864108},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-09-19T16:52:47+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:57+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":231699,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Die alternative Kunst-, Kultur- und Stadtteilinitiative Recyclart betreibt einen der dynamischsten Orte der Stadt. Zwischen Kunst und gesellschaftlichen Themen bietet Recyclart eine bunte und eklektische Vielfalt an Veranstaltungen und Initiativen. Und seit dem Standortwechsel von dem stillgelegten Bahnhof Bruxelles-Chapelle in ein sch\u00f6nes Geb\u00e4ude mit charmanter Terrasse in einem fast schon Berlinerisch anmutenden Innenhof weht seit 2018 abermals ein frischer Wind. Das Projekt f\u00e4chert sich in drei Bereiche auf: Ein Kunstzentrum, die Bar Recyclart (Bar und Restaurant) und die Recyclart Fabrik (Infra-\/Holz-\/Metallwerkst\u00e4tten) mit Wiedereingliederungsma\u00dfnahmen f\u00fcr Langzeitarbeitslose.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Created in 2000 and now located in Molenbeek since 2018, Recyclart is a multidisciplinary urban project that draws inspiration from the city and its district. A landmark in the history of underground culture in Brussels, it is composed of an ARTS CENTRE and two socio-professional integration projects, namely the RECYCLART BAR and the RECYCLART FABRIK (infra\/wood\/metal workshops).\r\n\r\nAs an art centre, Recyclart connects art to the urban context in which it is embedded. This context acts as a source of inspiration f