"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006461"},"fr":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e : James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels","shortdescr":"Au cours de cette visite, vous d\u00e9couvrirez comment le langage image de James Ensor est n\u00e9 dans la ville anim\u00e9e de Bruxelles.","longdescr":"Au-del\u00e0 du masque, d\u00e9couvrez comment le langage imag\u00e9 de James Ensor est n\u00e9 dans la ville anim\u00e9e de Bruxelles \u00e0 la fin du 19e si\u00e8cle. Un guide vous emm\u00e8nera \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte de l\u2019exposition \u00ab James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels \u00bb : des ann\u00e9es d\u2019\u00e9tude d\u2019Ensor \u00e0 l\u2019Acad\u00e9mie des Beaux-Arts, \u00e0 la cr\u00e9ation de ses premiers chefs-d\u2019\u0153uvre, en passant par ses m\u00e9c\u00e8nes et les salons du groupe d\u2019artistes \u00ab Les XX \u00bb. Au cours de cette visite, vous admirerez \u00e9galement le palais de Charles de Lorraine, qui \u00e9tait, \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9poque, le lieu de rencontre du monde de l\u2019art d\u2019avant-garde dans la capitale.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/agenda","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006461"},"sp":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e : James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/agenda","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006461"},"nl":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e : James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/agenda","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url