00e9e de Louvain, 195","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Jazz Station","address_street_name":"Leuvensesteenweg","address_street_number":"195","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@jazzstation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.jazzstation.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 733 13 78","phone_booking":"+32 2 733 13 78","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Leuvensesteenweg, 195","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"The Jazz Station has become one of the highlights of Jazz in Belgium. Established in an old station completely restored, it is more than a classic Jazz club. In addition to the concerts it hosts exhibitions, artists residencies, festivals, courses, music conferences, as well as public rehearsals and aperitif concerts.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Jazz Station","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Louvain","address_street_number":"195","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@jazzstation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.jazzstation.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 733 13 78","phone_booking":"+32 2 733 13 78","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Louvain, 195","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Jazz Station","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Louvain","address_street_number":"195","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@jazzstation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.jazzstation.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 733 13 78","phone_booking":"+32 2 733 13 78","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Louvain, 195","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Jazz Station","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Louvain","address_street_number":"195","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@jazzstation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.jazzstation.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 733 13 78","phone_booking":"+32 2 733 13 78","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Louvain, 195","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Rien que pour son emplacement, Jazz Station vaut la visite. O\u00f9 ailleurs dans le monde peut-on assister \u00e0 un spectacle de jazz dans une gare du 19e si\u00e8cle ? Ce centre musical anim\u00e9 se trouve litt\u00e9ralement sur les rails qui relient la gare du Nord au quartier L\u00e9opold. Sur le plan architectural, elle se distingue par son style n\u00e9o-Renaissance flamand aux influences baroques braban\u00e7onnes. \u00c0 l'int\u00e9rieur, c'est encore plus int\u00e9ressant : outre les expositions, les r\u00e9p\u00e9titions, les s\u00e9ances d'\u00e9coute et les conf\u00e9rences sur l'histoire du jazz, vous pouvez \u00e9galement vous y rendre plusieurs fois par semaine pour des concerts de la cr\u00e8me de la cr\u00e8me du jazz belge et international. \u202f \r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Jazz Station","address_street_name":"Chauss\u00e9e de Louvain","address_street_number":"195","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@jazzstation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.jazzstation.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 733 13 78","phone_booking":"+32 2 733 13 78","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Chauss\u00e9e de Louvain, 195","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Jazz Station","address_street_name":"Leuvensesteenweg","address_street_number":"195","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@jazzstation.be","website":"http:\/\/www.jazzstation.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 733 13 78","phone_booking":"+32 2 733 13 78","address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Leuvensesteenweg, 195","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":"Alleen al voor de locatie is Jazz Station een bezoek meer dan waard. Waar elders ter wereld kan je genieten van een jazzoptreden in een treinstation uit de 19de eeuw? Dit levendige muziekcentrum bevindt zich letterlijk bovenop de sporen die het Noordstation met de Leopoldswijk verbinden. Architecturaal onderscheidt het zich door zijn Vlaamse neorenaissancestijl met Brabantse barokinvloeden. Binnenin wordt het nog interessanter: naast tentoonstellingen, repetities, luistersessies en lezingen over de jazzgeschiedenis, kan je er ook meerdere malen per week terecht voor een (na)zinderend concert van de cr\u00e8me de la cr\u00e8me van de Belgische en internationale jazzscene. \u202f\u202f\u202f ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[9],"translations":{"de":["Europ\u00e4isches Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["European Quarter"],"it":["Quartiere europeo"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Quartier europ\u00e9en"],"sp":["Barrio Europeo"],"nl":["Europese wijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[22],"translations":{"de":["Osten"],"pt":[null],"en":["East"],"it":["Est"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Est"],"sp":["Este"],"nl":["Oost"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":"JazzStationBruxelles\u202f\u202f","backoffice_id":5396,"location":{"lat":50.8506056,"lon":4.3805986},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-01-08T11:49:08+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:18:37+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id"