:["Familie","Jongeren 15-18 j.","Senioren"]}},"educational_targets":{"list":[],"translations":{}},"tags":["kids"]},{"id":50006988,"date_start":"2024-02-29","date_end":"2024-02-29","date_next":"2024-02-29","accept_article27":false,"accept_cultuurbon":false,"accept_paspartoe":false,"is_closed_on_public_holidays":false,"is_closed_on_school_holidays":false,"is_only_by_appointment":false,"is_permanent":false,"is_free":false,"is_pay_as_you_can":true,"is_online":false,"is_canceled":false,"is_soldout":false,"last_updated_at":"2024-02-07T12:45:01+01:00","published_at":"2024-02-07T12:44:10+01:00","publication_state":"public","date_embargo":null,"show_in_agenda":true,"is_outside":false,"is_high_capacity":false,"is_not_major_event":false,"backoffice_id":294034,"facebook_link":null,"import_origin":null,"is_part_of":null,"sub_type":"concert","ranking":1.2599210498948732,"languages":{"spoken":["nl","en","fr"],"subtitles":[]},"categories":{"main":{"id":1,"translations":{"de":"Konzert","pt":null,"en":"Concert","it":"Concerti","cn":null,"fr":"Concert","sp":"Concierto","nl":"Concert"}},"others":{}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Sad Banana + Anna De Sutter + Second Skin + Estelle Saignes + L\u00e9onore Bienert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/nl\/agenda\/sad-banana-anna-de-sutter-second-skin-estelle-saignes-leonore-bienert","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006988"},"pt":{"name":"Sad Banana + Anna De Sutter + Second Skin + Estelle Saignes + L\u00e9onore Bienert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/nl\/agenda\/sad-banana-anna-de-sutter-second-skin-estelle-saignes-leonore-bienert","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006988"},"en":{"name":"Sad Banana + Anna De Sutter + Second Skin + Estelle Saignes + L\u00e9onore Bienert","shortdescr":"Sad Banana biedt een existenti\u00eble fruitsalade in concert, schommelend tussen bravoure en angst. Anna's liedjes, video's, installaties en optredens versmelten pop, cabaret, punk en po\u00ebzie om je onder te dompelen in het alledaagse leven en diepe thema's. Met de opblaasbare bubbel van Second Skin verken je een buitengewone ervaring, waarbij je de grenzen tussen realiteit en hallucinatie aftast.","longdescr":"SAD BANANA\n\nSad Banana probeert vanuit het perspectief van een banaan naar de wereld te kijken. Vanuit inconsistente beschouwingen poogt die een existenti\u00eble fruitsalade te maken in de vorm van een muziekconcert, vervuld met teksten die laveren tussen grootspraak en paniekaanval, kwetsbaarheid en kitsch, politiek en pastiche. Sad! \n\nBananen zijn kwetsbare vruchten. Ze worden groen geplukt, gewassen en verpakt in stevige kartonnen dozen. Het is in deze doos dat de banaan droevig werd en besefte dat die tegen wil en dank het symbool is geworden van het doorgedreven globalisme. Sad Banana cultiveert deze tristesse in tekst, muziek en beeld. Sad B. gebruikt hun voorliefde voor punk, rapmuziek en dada\u00efsme om een eigentijdse verklanking te maken van wat het betekent om een overrijpe banaan te zijn in een post-kapitalistische wereld. Het stemt hun droevig, maar tranen worden beats als je ze goed weet te gebruiken. Sad!\n\n+\n\nANNA DE SUTTER\nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=ami-s5l8sEY&t=2s\n\nAnna De Sutter (\u00b01995) is a Brussels based multi-media artist. She holds a MFA (LUCA school of Arts, 2022) and a master in philosophy (KU Leuven, 2020). She makes songs, videos, (in-situ) installations and performances. With inspiration drawn from popculture she dramatizes and stages concepts about daily life and deeper existential themes like love&death. In her artistic work she finds a balance between her philosophical intrests and attraction towards playfulness and the absurd. ANNA is her alter-ego that does the performing. She brings self written and produced songs sometimes accompanied by poetic videos. In her shows she dances on the fine lines between pop music, cabaret, punk and poetry.\n\n+\n\nSECOND SKIN (Maarten Raskin & Jonas Synnave)\n\nWaaraan denkt het insect wanneer het in zijn net afgeworpen oude huid staart?\n\nSecond Skin - een nieuw project van Jonas Synnave en Maarten Raskin - is een \u2018out-of-body\u2019 ervaring die de grenzen opzoekt tussen realiteit en hallucinatie, tussen het fysieke en het virtuele, het organische en het technologische. Second Skin is een vervellingsproces dat oproept tot transformatie en zelfontdekking.\n\n@maarten_raskin\nwww.maartenraskin.com\n\n@jonassynnave.be\nwww.jonassynnave.be\n \n\n+\n\n \n\nESTELLE SAIGNES\n\nEstelle Saignes is een Frans-Amerikaanse kunstenares en performer die in 2020 afstudeerde aan ENSAV La Cambre met een Master in Textile Design. Ze werkt in het Green Fabric Textile Fablab in Vorst. Ze is gefascineerd door de narratieve reconstructie van specifieke plaatsen, door melodrama en door onze begrensde relaties met landschappen. Ze probeert mislukte idyllische ervaringen te synthetiseren door middel van weefsels, quilts en immersieve performances.\n\n+\n\nL\u00c9ONORE BIENERT\n\nL\u00e9onore Bienert (1998), a Brussels student in urban space at La Cambre adopts a playful approach, creating an organic environment, where the works invite to be experienced, touched and manipulated. We are all inhabited by a constant flow, a perpetual tension between the state of our body's matter\u2014fluids, smells, sweat, noise, and movement. Paradoxically, our consciousness enables us to detach from these sensations, to turn our gaze towards an outside world. This external world is characterized by the rigidity of its deeply rooted structures. It is only through intensive exercise, illness, or experiencing pain that we reconnect more with our body and its internal workings.\n\nThe continuity of fluidity not only reveals the ambiguity of the human body\u2014allowing us to navigate the inevitable opposition between a lived and a perceived body \u2014but also challenges binary and dualistic views rethinking relationships among things, individuals, and spaces. Keeping in mind the importance of movement, porosity, and transformation.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/nl\/agenda\/sad-banana-anna-de-sutter-second-skin-estelle-saignes-leonore-bienert","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006988"},"it":{"name":"Sad Banana + Anna De Sutter + Second Skin + Estelle Saignes + L\u00e9onore Bienert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/nl\/agenda\/sad-banana-anna-de-sutter-second-skin-estelle-saignes-leonore-bienert","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006988"},"cn":{"name":"Sad Banana + Anna De Sutter + Second Skin + Estelle Saignes + L\u00e9onore Bienert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/nl\/agenda\/sad-banana-anna-de-sutter-second-skin-estelle-saignes-leonore-bienert","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006988"},"fr":{"name":"Sad Banana + Anna De Sutter + Second Skin + Estelle Saignes + L\u00e9onore Bienert","shortdescr":"Sad Banana offre une salade de fruits existentielle en concert, oscillant entre bravades et angoisses. Une plong\u00e9e captivante dans la vie quotidienne avec les chansons, vid\u00e9os, installations et performances fusionnant pop, cabaret, punk et po\u00e9sie par Anna. Avec la bulle d\u2019aire de Second Skin, explorez une exp\u00e9rience extraordinaire, sondant les limites entre r\u00e9alit\u00e9 et hallucination. ","longdescr":"SAD BANANA\n\nSad Banana tente de regarder le monde du point de vue d'une banane. \u00c0 partir de r\u00e9flexionsdivergentes, iel tente de cr\u00e9er une salade de fruits existentielle ressemblant \u00e0 un concertmusical dont les paroles oscillent entre bravades et angoisses, vuln\u00e9rabilit\u00e9 et kitsch,politique et pastiche. Sad ! ... La banane est un fruit fragile. Elle est cueillie verte, lav\u00e9e,emball\u00e9e et transport\u00e9e dans des bo\u00eetes en carton. C'est dans ce carton que la banane estdevenue triste et qu'elle a r\u00e9alis\u00e9 que, contre sa volont\u00e9, elle \u00e9tait devenue le symbole d'unmondialisme omnipr\u00e9sent. Sad Banana cultive cette tristesse dans ses textes, sa musique etses images. Iel utilise son app\u00e9tit pour le punk, le rap et le dada\u00efsme pour cr\u00e9er uneinterpr\u00e9tation contemporaine de ce que signifie \u00eatre une banane trop m\u00fbre dans un mondepost-capitaliste.Sad B. est triste, mais iel sait que les larmes se transforment en beats si onles reconna\u00eet pour ce qu'elles sont. Sad!\n\n+\n\nANNA DE SUTTER\nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=ami-s5l8sEY&t=2s\n\nAnna De Sutter (\u00b01995) is a Brussels based multi-media artist. She holds a MFA (LUCA school of Arts, 2022) and a master in philosophy (KU Leuven, 2020). She makes songs, videos, (in-situ) installations and performances. With inspiration drawn from popculture she dramatizes and stages concepts about daily life and deeper existential themes like love&death. In her artistic work she finds a balance between her philosophical intrests and attraction towards playfulness and the absurd. ANNA is her alter-ego that does the performing. She brings self written and produced songs sometimes accompanied by poetic videos. In her shows she dances on the fine lines between pop music, cabaret, punk and poetry.\n\n+\n\nSECOND SKIN (Maarten Raskin & Jonas Synnave)\n\n\u00c0 quoi pense l'insecte lorsqu'il regarde sa vieille peau qu'il vient de perdre ?\n\nSecond Skin - un nouveau projet de Jonas Synnave et Maarten Raskin - est une exp\u00e9rience de hors-corps qui explore les fronti\u00e8res entre la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 et l'hallucination, entre le physique et le virtuel, l'organique et le technologique. Second Skin est un processus de mue qui appelle \u00e0 la transformation et \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte de soi.\n\n@maarten_raskin\nwww.maartenraskin.com\n\n@jonassynnave.be\nwww.jonassynnave.be\n+\n\nESTELLE SAIGNES\n\nEstelle Saignes est une artiste et performeuse fran\u00e7aise-am\u00e9ricaine dipl\u00f4m\u00e9e de l\u2019ENSAV La Cambre en 2020, avec un Master en Design Textile. Elle est \u00e9tablie au sein du Fablab Textile Green Fabric, \u00e0 Forest. Fascin\u00e9e par la reconstruction narrative d\u2019endroits pr\u00e9cis, par le m\u00e9lodrame et par des rapports contraints au paysage, elle cherche \u00e0 synth\u00e9tiser des exp\u00e9riences idylliques d\u00e9faillantes par le biais de tissages, de quilts et de performances - supports d'immersion.\n+\n\nL\u00c9ONORE BIENERT\n\nL\u00e9onore Bienert (1998), a Brussels student in urban space at La Cambre adopts a playful approach, creating an organic environment, where the works invite to be experienced, touched and manipulated. We are all inhabited by a constant flow, a perpetual tension between the state of our body's matter\u2014fluids, smells, sweat, noise, and movement. Paradoxically, our consciousness enables us to detach from these sensations, to turn our gaze towards an outside world. This external world is characterized by the rigidity of its deeply rooted structures. It is only through intensive exercise, illness, or experiencing pain that we reconnect more with our body and its internal workings.\n\nThe continuity of fluidity not only reveals the ambiguity of the human body\u2014allowing us to navigate the inevitable opposition between a lived and a perceived body \u2014but also challenges binary and dualistic views rethinking relationships among things, individuals, and spaces. Keeping in mind the importance of movement, porosity, and transformation.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/nl\/agenda\/sad-banana-anna-de-sutter-second-skin-estelle-saignes-leonore-bienert","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006988"},"sp":{"name":"Sad Banana + Anna De Sutter + Second Skin + Estelle Saignes + L\u00e9onore Bienert","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/nl\/agenda\/sad-banana-anna-de-sutter-second-skin-estelle-saignes-leonore-bienert","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006988"},"nl":{"name":"Sad Banana + Anna De Sutter + Second Skin + Estelle Saignes + L\u00e9onore Bienert","shortdescr":"Sad Banana biedt een existenti\u00eble fruitsalade in concert, schommelend tussen bravoure en angst. Anna's liedjes, video's, installaties en optredens versmelten pop, cabaret, punk en po\u00ebzie om je onder te dompelen in het alledaagse leven en diepe thema's. Met de opblaasbare bubbel van Second Skin verken je een buitengewone ervaring, waarbij je de grenzen tussen realiteit en hallucinatie aftast.","longdescr":"SAD BANANA\n\nSad Banana probeert vanuit het perspectief van een banaan naar de wereld te kijken. Vanuit inconsistente beschouwingen poogt die een existenti\u00eble fruitsalade te maken in de vorm van een muziekconcert, vervuld met teksten die laveren tussen grootspraak en paniekaanval, kwetsbaarheid en kitsch, politiek en pastiche. Sad! \n\nBananen zijn kwetsbare vruchten. Ze worden groen geplukt, gewassen en verpakt in stevige kartonnen dozen. Het is in deze doos dat de banaan droevig werd en besefte dat die tegen wil en dank het symbool is geworden van het doorgedreven globalisme. Sad Banana cultiveert deze tristesse in tekst, muziek en beeld. Sad B. gebruikt hun voorliefde voor punk, rapmuziek en dada\u00efsme om een eigentijdse verklanking te maken van wat het betekent om een overrijpe banaan te zijn in een post-kapitalistische wereld. Het stemt hun droevig, maar tranen worden beats als je ze goed weet te gebruiken. Sad!\n\n+\n\nANNA DE SUTTER\nhttps:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=ami-s5l8sEY&t=2s\n\nAnna De Sutter (\u00b01995) is a Brussels based multi-media artist. She holds a MFA (LUCA school of Arts, 2022) and a master in philosophy (KU Leuven, 2020). She makes songs, videos, (in-situ) installations and performances. With inspiration drawn from popculture she dramatizes and stages concepts about daily life and deeper existential themes like love&death. In her artistic work she finds a balance between her philosophical intrests and attraction towards playfulness and the absurd. ANNA is her alter-ego that does the performing. She brings self written and produced songs sometimes accompanied by poetic videos. In her shows she dances on the fine lines between pop music, cabaret, punk and poetry.\n\n+\n\nSECOND SKIN (Maarten Raskin & Jonas Synnave)\n\nWaaraan denkt het insect wanneer het in zijn net afgeworpen oude huid staart?\n\nSecond Skin - een nieuw project van Jonas Synnave en Maarten Raskin - is een \u2018out-of-body\u2019 ervaring die de grenzen opzoekt tussen realiteit en hallucinatie, tussen het fysieke en het virtuele, het organische en het technologische. Second Skin is een vervellingsproces dat oproept tot transformatie en zelfontdekking.\n\n@maarten_raskin\nwww.maartenraskin.com\n\n@jonassynnave.be\nwww.jonassynnave.be\n \n\n+\n\n \n\nESTELLE SAIGNES\n\nEstelle Saignes is een Frans-Amerikaanse kunstenares en performer die in 2020 afstudeerde aan ENSAV La Cambre met een Master in Textile Design. Ze werkt in het Green Fabric Textile Fablab in Vorst. Ze is gefascineerd door de narratieve reconstructie van specifieke plaatsen, door melodrama en door onze begrensde relaties met landschappen. Ze probeert mislukte idyllische ervaringen te synthetiseren door middel van weefsels, quilts en immersieve performances.\n\n+\n\nL\u00c9ONORE BIENERT\n\nL\u00e9onore Bienert (1998), a Brussels student in urban space at La Cambre adopts a playful approach, creating an organic environment, where the works invite to be experienced, touched and manipulated. We are all inhabited by a constant flow, a perpetual tension between the state of our body's matter\u2014fluids, smells, sweat, noise, and movement. Paradoxically, our consciousness enables us to detach from these sensations, to turn our gaze towards an outside world. This external world is characterized by the rigidity of its deeply rooted structures. It is only through intensive exercise, illness, or experiencing pain that we reconnect more with our body and its internal workings.\n\nThe continuity of fluidity not only reveals the ambiguity of the human body\u2014allowing us to navigate the inevitable opposition between a lived and a perceived body \u2014but also challenges binary and dualistic views rethinking relationships among things, individuals, and spaces. Keeping in mind the importance of movement, porosity, and transformation.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/recyclart.be\/nl\/agenda\/sad-banana-anna-de-sutter-second-skin-estelle-saignes-leonore-bienert","email":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006988"}},"place":{"id":231699,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Die alternative Kunst-, Kultur- und Stadtteilinitiative Recyclart betreibt einen der dynamischsten Orte der Stadt. Zwischen Kunst und gesellschaftlichen Themen bietet Recyclart eine bunte und eklektische Vielfalt an Veranstaltungen und Initiativen. Und seit dem Standortwechsel von dem stillgelegten Bahnhof Bruxelles-Chapelle in ein sch\u00f6nes Geb\u00e4ude mit charmanter Terrasse in einem fast schon Berlinerisch anmutenden Innenhof weht seit 2018 abermals ein frischer Wind. Das Projekt f\u00e4chert sich in drei Bereiche auf: Ein Kunstzentrum, die Bar Recyclart (Bar und Restaurant) und die Recyclart Fabrik (Infra-\/Holz-\/Metallwerkst\u00e4tten) mit Wiedereingliederungsma\u00dfnahmen f\u00fcr Langzeitarbeitslose.\r\n\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Created in 2000 and now located in Molenbeek since 2018, Recyclart is a multidisciplinary urban project that draws inspiration from the city and its district. A landmark in the history of underground culture in Brussels, it is composed of an ARTS CENTRE and two socio-professional integration projects, namely the RECYCLART BAR and the RECYCLART FABRIK (infra\/wood\/metal workshops).\r\n\r\nAs an art centre, Recyclart connects art to the urban context in which it is embedded. This context acts as a source of inspiration for the artistic activities and, conversely, Recyclart also uses its artistic programme as a catalyst to open up this same urban context and make it more liveable. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Cr\u00e9\u00e9 en 2000 et relocalis\u00e9 depuis 2018 \u00e0 Molenbeek, Recyclart est un projet urbain pluridisciplinaire qui s'inspire de la ville et de son quartier. Haut lieu de l\u2019histoire de la culture underground \u00e0 Bruxelles, il se compose d\u2019un CENTRE D\u2019ARTS et de deux projets d\u2019insertion socioprofessionnelle que sont le BAR RECYCLART et le RECYCLART FABRIK (ateliers infra\/bois\/m\u00e9tal).\r\n\r\nEn tant que centre artistique, Recyclart relie l'art au contexte urbain dans lequel il s'inscrit. Ce contexte sert de source d'inspiration pour les activit\u00e9s artistiques et, inversement, Recyclart utilise \u00e9galement son programme artistique comme un catalyseur pour ouvrir ce m\u00eame contexte urbain et le rendre plus vivable. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"Manchesterstraat ","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Manchesterstraat , 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Het multidisciplinaire stadsproject Recyclart bestaat sinds 2000 en verhuisde in 2018 naar Molenbeek, waar het zich blijft inspireren op de stad en de wijk.  Als een van de belangrijkste plekken in de Brusselse underground-geschiedenis combineert het een KUNSTENCENTRUM met twee sociale integratieprojecten, BAR RECYCLART en RECYCLART FABRIK (werkplaats voor hout-, metaal- en infrastructuurwerk).\r\n\r\nMet het kunstencentrum verbindt Recyclart kunst met de stedelijke context waar het deel van uitmaakt. De stad dient als inspiratiebron voor de artistieke activiteiten, maar ook omgekeerd zet Recyclart haar artistieke programma in als katalysator, om zo diezelfde stedelijke context toegankelijker en leefbaarder te maken.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[8],"translations":{"de":["Kanal-Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Canal"],"it":["Canal"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Canal"],"sp":["Canal"],"nl":["Kanaalwijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[23],"translations":{"de":["Westen"],"pt":[null],"en":["West"],"it":["Ovest"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Ouest"],"sp":["Oeste"],"nl":["West"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":"RECYCLARTBXL","backoffice_id":973,"location":{"lat":50.84757339,"lon":4.32864108},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-09-19T16:52:47+02:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:57+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":231699,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Recyclart","address_street_name":"rue de Manchester","address_street_number":"13-15","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@recyclart.be","website":"http:\/\/www.recyclart.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 502 57 34","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"rue de Manchester, 13-15","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Die alternative Kunst-, Kultur- und Stadtteilinitiative Recyclart betreibt einen der dynamischsten Orte der Stadt. Zwischen Kunst und gesellschaftlichen Themen bietet Recyclart eine bunte und eklektische Vielfalt an Veransta