itiquement sensibles ? Est-il permis de se r\u00e9jouir de la douceur de l\u2019hiver quand la plan\u00e8te br\u00fble ? Le d\u00e9bat d\u2019opinion se teinte d\u2019humour et d\u2019amour. Et les secrets les mieux gard\u00e9s refont surface.\nAlors qu\u2019il est des domaines o\u00f9 la parole se lib\u00e8re, il y a des choses qu\u2019on ne peut plus dire. Des petits mots du quotidien aux questions existentielles en passant par les secrets de famille, elle et lui se disent et se contredisent.\nOn rit, on sourit, on est ravi.","performers":"Avec Catherine Conet, Alain Leempoel, H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Theunissen et Bernard Yerl\u00e8s.\nMise en sc\u00e8ne : Alain Leempoel\nSc\u00e9nographie : No\u00e9mie Vanheste\nCostumes : Chandra Vellut","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.trg.be","email":"location@trg.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 04 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 04 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006829"},"sp":{"name":"Fallait pas le dire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.trg.be","email":"location@trg.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 04 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 04 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006829"},"nl":{"name":"Fallait pas le dire","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.trg.be","email":"location@trg.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 04 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 04 07","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006829"}},"place":{"id":624,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Royal des Galeries","address_street_name":"Galerie du Roi","address_street_number":"32","address_street_box":null,"email":"infos@trg.be","website":"http:\/\/www.trg.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 512 04 07","phone_booking":"+32 2 512 04 07","address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Galerie du 