:"OUT OF FRAME - Repenser les narrations visuelles sur les migrations en Europe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/geopolis.brussels\/2024\/01\/25\/out-of-frame-nouvelle-exposition-a-geopolis-a-partir-du-1er-fevrier\/","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":"+32 485 32 85 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006495"},"pt":{"name":"OUT OF FRAME - Repenser les narrations visuelles sur les migrations en Europe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/geopolis.brussels\/2024\/01\/25\/out-of-frame-nouvelle-exposition-a-geopolis-a-partir-du-1er-fevrier\/","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":"+32 485 32 85 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006495"},"en":{"name":"OUT OF FRAME - Repenser les narrations visuelles sur les migrations en Europe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/geopolis.brussels\/2024\/01\/25\/out-of-frame-nouvelle-exposition-a-geopolis-a-partir-du-1er-fevrier\/","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":"+32 485 32 85 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006495"},"it":{"name":"OUT OF FRAME - Repenser les narrations visuelles sur les migrations en Europe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/geopolis.brussels\/2024\/01\/25\/out-of-frame-nouvelle-exposition-a-geopolis-a-partir-du-1er-fevrier\/","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":"+32 485 32 85 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006495"},"cn":{"name":"OUT OF FRAME - Repenser les narrations visuelles sur les migrations en Europe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/geopolis.brussels\/2024\/01\/25\/out-of-frame-nouvelle-exposition-a-geopolis-a-partir-du-1er-fevrier\/","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":"+32 485 32 85 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006495"},"fr":{"name":"OUT OF FRAME - Repenser les narrations visuelles sur les migrations en Europe","shortdescr":"\u00c0 travers sept \u0153uvres photographiques, l\u2019exposition dont la sc\u00e9nographie a \u00e9t\u00e9 r\u00e9alis\u00e9e par Giulia Tornari \u00e9voque la repr\u00e9sentation des ph\u00e9nom\u00e8nes migratoires en Europe au cours des ann\u00e9es 2015 \u00e0 2022, dans un contexte de politisation croissante et de polarisation id\u00e9ologique.","longdescr":"L\u2019installation pr\u00e9sente le r\u00e9cit d\u00e9peint par la plupart des reportages des m\u00e9dias europ\u00e9ens, celui d\u2019une Europe assi\u00e9g\u00e9e et envahie \u00e0 ses fronti\u00e8res par des milliers de migrants. Les photographies nourrissent quotidiennement notre imagination, alimentant les m\u00eames clich\u00e9s. Les histoires personnelles et le contexte migratoire sont trop souvent n\u00e9glig\u00e9s avec pour principale cons\u00e9quence la d\u00e9shumanisation des personnes migrantes. \n\nOut of Frame vise \u00e0 changer cette perspective en pr\u00e9sentant les \u0153uvres de six artistes qui ont travaill\u00e9 sur les ph\u00e9nom\u00e8nes migratoires contemporains en pla\u00e7ant les migrants au centre de leurs projets photographiques. \n\nL\u2019exposition de photos \u00ab Out of frame \u2013 Repenser les narrations visuelles sur les migrations \u00bb fait partie du projet interdisciplinaire \u00ab Bridges : Assessing the production and impact of migration narratives \u00bb.\n\nEn pr\u00e9sence de Giulia Tornari (commissaire pour Zona), Blanca Garc\u00e9s Mascare\u00f1as (pour Cidob | Barcelona Centre for International Affairs) et Ferruccio Pastore (pour Fieri | Forum International et Europ\u00e9en de Recherches sur l\u2019Immigration).","performers":"Les photographes : \nMiia Autio\nFelipe Romero Beltran\nSamuel Gratacap\nAlessio Mamo\nAlisa Martinova\nAubrey Wade","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/geopolis.brussels\/2024\/01\/25\/out-of-frame-nouvelle-exposition-a-geopolis-a-partir-du-1er-fevrier\/","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":"+32 485 32 85 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006495"},"sp":{"name":"OUT OF FRAME - Repenser les narrations visuelles sur les migrations en Europe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/geopolis.brussels\/2024\/01\/25\/out-of-frame-nouvelle-exposition-a-geopolis-a-partir-du-1er-fevrier\/","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":"+32 485 32 85 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006495"},"nl":{"name":"OUT OF FRAME - Repenser les narrations visuelles sur les migrations en Europe","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/geopolis.brussels\/2024\/01\/25\/out-of-frame-nouvelle-exposition-a-geopolis-a-partir-du-1er-fevrier\/","email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":"+32 485 32 85 90","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006495"}},"place":{"id":269816,"translations":{"de":{"name":"G\u00e9opolis","address_street_name":"Rue des Tanneurs","address_street_number":"58-60","address_street_box":null,"email":"contact@geopolis.brussels","website":"http:\/\/geopolis.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 485 32 85 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue des Tanneurs, 58-60","address