"Pluridisciplinaire","Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Multidisciplinar","Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Multidisciplinair","Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Sofhie Mavroudis - 'A bread in the wall'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.centrale.brussels","email":"info@centrale.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 279 64 02","phone_booking":"+32 2 279 64 02","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560116"},"pt":{"name":"Sofhie Mavroudis - 'A bread in the wall'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.centrale.brussels","email":"info@centrale.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 279 64 02","phone_booking":"+32 2 279 64 02","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560116"},"en":{"name":"Sofhie Mavroudis - 'A bread in the wall'","shortdescr":"Sofhie Mavroudis presents the exhibition A bread in the wall at CENTRALE | box (23.11.2023 > 17.03.2024).","longdescr":"The artist questions the notion of transmission, particularly through language and traditions.\r\n\r\nStarting from an incomplete knowledge of her father\u2019s language, she uses gesture as the initiator of a change of state and confers \u2013 on the various objects thus created \u2013 a symbolism of their own.\r\n\r\nStarting with a book written in Greek, the artist erases the words she does not understand. She seeks a creative process that allows the transformation of this object, which has lost its primary role of transmitting history, into a process close to resilience.","performers":"Sofhie Mavroudis","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.centrale.brussels","email":"info@centrale.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 279 64 02","phone_booking":"+32 2 279 64 02","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560116"},"it":{"name":"Sofhie Mavroudis - 'A bread in the wall'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.centrale.brussels","email":"info@centrale.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 279 64 02","phone_booking":"+32 2 279 64 02","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560116"},"cn":{"name":"Sofhie Mavroudis - 'A bread in the wall'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.centrale.brussels","email":"info@centrale.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 279 64 02","phone_booking":"+32 2 279 64 02","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560116"},"fr":{"name":"Sofhie Mavroudis - 'A bread in the wall'","shortdescr":"Sofhie Mavroudis pr\u00e9sente l\u2019exposition A bread in the wall \u00e0 la CENTRALE | box (23.11.2023 > 17.03.2024).","longdescr":"L\u2019artiste y questionne la notion de transmission, notamment \u00e0 travers la langue et les traditions.\r\n\r\nPartant d\u2019une connaissance incompl\u00e8te de sa langue paternelle, elle utilise le geste comme initiateur d\u2019un changement d\u2019\u00e9tat et conf\u00e8re aux diff\u00e9rents objets ainsi cr\u00e9\u00e9s une symbolique qui leur est propre.\r\n\r\nAu d\u00e9part d\u2019un livre \u00e9crit en grec dont l\u2019artiste efface les mots dont elle ne comprend pas le sens, elle recherche un proc\u00e9d\u00e9 de cr\u00e9ation permettant la transformation de cet objet ayant perdu son r\u00f4le premier de transmetteur d\u2019histoire, en un processus proche de la r\u00e9silience.","performers":"Sofhie Mavroudis","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.centrale.brussels","email":"info@centrale.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 279 64 02","phone_booking":"+32 2 279 64 02","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560116"},"sp":{"name":"Sofhie Mavroudis - 'A bread in the wall'","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.centrale.brussels","email":"info@centrale.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 279 64 02","phone_booking":"+32 2 279 64 02","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560116"},"nl":{"name":"Sofhie Mavroudis - 'A bread in the wall'","shortdescr":"Sofhie Mavroudis stelt de tentoonstelling A bread in the wall in CENTRALE | box (23.11.2023 > 17.03.2024) voor.","longdescr":"De kunstenares stelt de notie van overdracht in vraag, met name via taal en tradities.\r\n\r\nOp basis van een onvolledige kennis van de taal van haar vader, gebruikt ze gebaren als initiator van een verandering van toestand en kent ze aan de verschillende objecten die zo ontstaan een eigen symboliek toe.\r\n\r\nDe kunstenares vertrekt van een in het Grieks geschreven boek, waaruit ze de woorden wist die ze niet begrijpt. Ze zoekt naar een creatief proces dat de transformatie mogelijk maakt van dit object, dat zijn primaire rol van het overdragen van geschiedenis heeft verloren, in een proces dat dicht bij veerkracht staat.","performers":"Sofhie Mavroudis","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.centrale.brussels","email":"info@centrale.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 279 64 02","phone_booking":"+32 2 279 64 02","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.560116"}},"place":{"id":263549,"translations":{"de":{"name":"CENTRALE.box","address_street_name":"Place Sainte-Catherine","address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":"info@centrale.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.centrale.brussels","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2-279.64.44","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Place Sainte-Catherine","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"La CENTRALE | box ist ein Ort, der junge, aufstrebende K\u00fcnstler f\u00f6rdert und sie bei der Entwicklung ihres Projekts unterst\u00fctzt.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":