l,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Art et marges mus\u00e9e","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Situ\u00e9 au c\u0153ur de Bruxelles, le Art et marges mus\u00e9e, mus\u00e9e d\u2019art brut - contemporain - outsider art, questionne l\u2019art et ses fronti\u00e8res. Sa collection s\u2019est constitu\u00e9e d\u00e8s le milieu des ann\u00e9es 80 aupr\u00e8s d\u2019artistes autodidactes, d\u2019ateliers artistiques pour personnes porteuses d\u2019un handicap mental ou d\u2019ateliers en milieu psychiatrique. Elle se compose aujourd\u2019hui de plus de 4000 \u0153uvres internationales produites en dehors des sentiers fr\u00e9quent\u00e9s de l\u2019art. Ses expositions temporaires, au rythme de deux \u00e0 trois par an, m\u00ealent artistes de part et d\u2019autre de la marge et questionnent l\u2019art et sa d\u00e9finition-m\u00eame. ","description_print":"Mus\u00e9e d'art outsider","booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Museo Art)&(Marges","address_street_name":"Rue Haute","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue Haute, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Desde su creaci\u00f3n, el Centro de Investigaci\u00f3n y Difusi\u00f3n del arte outsider Art en Marge (que se convirti\u00f3 posteriormente en el museo Art)&Marges) aboga por los artistas que no forman parte del circuito cultural oficial. Los conocidos actualmente como \u00aboutsiders\u00bb (ver glosario) son creadores autodidactas que trabajan solos o en talleres creativos para personas psicol\u00f3gicamente vulnerables o con alguna discapacidad mental. Algunos son internos de residencias para discapacitados mentales, hospitales psiqui\u00e1tricos, y otros son trabajadores o extrabajadores de una amplia gama de profesiones: fot\u00f3grafos, anticuarios, zapateros, m\u00fasicos...","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Art & marges museum","address_street_name":"Hoogstraat","address_street_number":"314","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@artetmarges.be","website":"http:\/\/www.artetmarges.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 533 94 90","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Hoogstraat, 314","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Outsiderkunst museum. Sinds zijn oprichting in 1984 en de eerste tentoonstelling in 1986, verdedigt de vzw Art en Marge - het huidige art )&( marges museum - kunstenaars die uit de boot van het offici\u00eble culturele circuit vallen. Die autodidactische kunstenaars worden \u201coutsiders\u201d genoemd en werken alleen of in creatieve workshops voor zieke of gehandicapte personen. Naast de permanente verzameling, zorgen tijdelijke tentoonstellingen voor een dynamische dialoog met de werken van professionele kunstenaars die actief zijn in het offici\u00eble culturele milieu, om de grenzen van de in- en outsiderkunst af te tasten. art )&( marges museum is geen ghettomuseum maar een plaats van uitwisseling, een ruimte waarin de individualiteit hoogtij viert en waarin alles in het werk gesteld wordt om ervoor te zorgen dat alle doelgroepen zich thuis voelen.\r\n\r\nOpen op vrijdag, zaterdag en zondag tussen 11.00 en 17.30 uur, alleen op afspraak.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":149,"location":{"lat":50.83472811,"lon":4.3463823},"last_updated_at":"2024-01-25T14:15:52+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:13:19+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/ad4235fd834ce0a9c6b3b304cd3f4c1fa1e36712.jpg","width":4167,"height":2917,"ratio":1.43,"oEmbed_height":2917,"oEmbed_width":4167,"translations":{"de":{"title":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","copyright":null},"fr":{"title":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","copyright":null}}},{"type":"poster","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/759d031f82802fb3322fb935411c7d88214a75d7.jpg","width":3508,"height":4961,"ratio":0.71,"oEmbed_height":4961,"oEmbed_width":3508,"translations":{"de":{"title":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"N'appelez pas \u00e7a Art brut","copyright":null},"cn":{"ti