:null,"website":"https:\/\/sint-joost-ten-node.bibliotheek.be\/agenda\/dag-van-de-thuistalen","email":"bibliotheek@sjtn.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 201 00 97","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006953"},"it":{"name":"Dag van de Thuistalen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/sint-joost-ten-node.bibliotheek.be\/agenda\/dag-van-de-thuistalen","email":"bibliotheek@sjtn.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 201 00 97","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006953"},"cn":{"name":"Dag van de Thuistalen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/sint-joost-ten-node.bibliotheek.be\/agenda\/dag-van-de-thuistalen","email":"bibliotheek@sjtn.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 201 00 97","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006953"},"fr":{"name":"Journ\u00e9e des langues maternelles","shortdescr":"Le 21 f\u00e9vrier, l'UNESCO c\u00e9l\u00e8bre la Journ\u00e9e internationale de la langue maternelle !\n14h Carrousel d' histoires multilingues.\n15h30 et \u00e0 16h Chantons! berceuses et comptines de notre enfance. \nExpo Idiotmatic: Un recueil aux petits oignons d'expressions qui d\u00e9coiffent.\nRendez visite \u00e0 la M\u00e9decine des Langues.\nIl y aura aussi du caf\u00e9 et des gaufres.","longdescr":"Le 21 f\u00e9vrier, l'UNESCO c\u00e9l\u00e8bre la Journ\u00e9e internationale de la langue maternelle !\nEntre 14h et 15h on fait sonner plusieurs langues: venez \u00e9couter de courtes histoires en anglais, turc, espagnol, italien, bulgare, darija, arabe, fran\u00e7ais et n\u00e9erlandais. Pour enfants et leurs parents.\n\u00c0 15h30 et \u00e0 16h on baisse la lumi\u00e8re: on \u00e9voque les berceuses et comptines de notre enfance. Vous souvenez-vous? Bienvenue \u00e0 chanter avec nous.\nEn continue: Expo Idiotmatic: Un recueil aux petits oignons d'expressions qui d\u00e9coiffent.\nRendez visite \u00e0 la M\u00e9decine des Langues. Divers jeux lui permettent de cartographier votre plurilinguisme. Enfants et adultes peuvent prendre place dans son cabinet.\nIl y aura aussi du caf\u00e9 et des gaufres.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/sint-joost-ten-node.bibliotheek.be\/agenda\/dag-van-de-thuistalen","email":"bibliotheek@sjtn.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 201 00 97","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006953"},"sp":{"name":"Dag van de Thuistalen","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/sint-joost-ten-node.bibliotheek.be\/agenda\/dag-van-de-thuistalen","email":"bibliotheek@sjtn.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 201 00 97","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006953"},"nl":{"name":"Dag van de Thuistalen","shortdescr":"Op 21 februari viert UNESCO de Internationale Dag van de thuistalen!\n14u: kom luisteren naar korte verhalen verschillende talen. \n15u30: Zingen! Ken jij nog slaapliedjes en kinderliedjes die jullie thuis vroeger zongen? \nDoorlopend: Expo Idiomatic: een uitgelezen verzameling haarscherpe uitdrukkingen in verschillende talen en breng een bezoekje aan de Talendokter.\nWafels en koffie zijn er ook.","longdescr":"\n\nOp 21 februari viert UNESCO de Internationale Dag van de thuistalen!\n\nTussen 14u en 15u laten we vele talen klinken: kom luisteren naar korte verhalen in Engels, Turks, Spaans, Italiaans, Bulgaars, Darija, Arabisch, Frans & Nederlands. Voor kinderen en hun ouders.\n\nOm 15u30 en 16u dimmen we lichten: Ken jij nog slaapliedjes en kinderliedjes die jullie thuis vroeger zongen? Voel je vrij om mee te zingen.\n\nDoorlopend: Expo Idiomatic: een uitgelezen verzameling haarscherpe uitdrukkingen in verschillende talen. En breng een bezoekje aan de Talendokter, die met spelletjes jouw meertaligheid in kaart brengt. Kinderen en volwassenen kunnen plaatsnemen in haar kabinet.\n\nWafels en koffie zijn er ook.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/sint-joost-ten-node.bibliotheek.be\/agenda\/dag-van-de-thuistalen","email":"bibliotheek@sjtn.brussels","phone_contact":"+32 2 201 00 97","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006953"}},"place":{"id":249573,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Bib Joske","address_street_name":"Rue de la Limite","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"bibliotheek@sjtn.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.sint-joost-ten-node.bibliotheek.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 201 00 97","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue de la Limite, 2","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Bib Joske","address_street_name":"Rue de la Limite","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"bibliotheek@sjtn.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.sint-joost-ten-node.bibliotheek.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 201 00 97","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue de la Limite, 2","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Bib Joske","address_street_name":"Rue de la Limite","address_street_number":"2","address_street_box":null,"email":"bibliotheek@sjtn.brussels","website":"http:\/\/www.sint-joost-ten-node.bibliotheek.be\/","phone_contact":"+32 2 201 00 97","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1210","address_city":"Saint-Josse-Ten-Noode","address_line1":"Rue de la Limite, 2","address_line2":"1210 Saint-Jo