cto Verso","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/instagram.com\/corpus_corpus_expo","email":"expo.corpus.corpus@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006440"},"en":{"name":"Recto Verso","shortdescr":"C O R P U S | C O R P U S is an immersive journey into the intricate interplay between the human body as an object and a subject. The exhibition presents seven powerful narratives rooted in the flesh, exploring themes of resilience, healing, empowerment, and identity.","longdescr":"C O R P U S | C O R P U S is an immersive journey into the intricate interplay between the human body as an object and a subject.\nThe work of the artists showcased delves into the tangible and intangible aspects of the human form and elevates the body to a vessel for emotions, stories and identity within the realm of art.\nThe exhibition presents seven powerful narratives rooted in the flesh, exploring themes of resilience, healing, empowerment, and identity.\n","performers":"Kimbra Audrey, Seattle\/Paris (@kimbraaudrey)\nLaetitia Bica, Brussels (@laetitiabica)\nLara Chahine, Beyrouth (@ _larachahine)\nLotte Cunnell, London (@lottecunnellart)\nElisa La Gala, Brussels\/Naples (@ellegieli)\nSaid Hammouch, Brussels (@ saidohammouch)\nPhilippine Schaefer, Paris (@philippine.schaefer)\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/instagram.com\/corpus_corpus_expo","email":"expo.corpus.corpus@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006440"},"it":{"name":"Recto Verso","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/instagram.com\/corpus_corpus_expo","email":"expo.corpus.corpus@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006440"},"cn":{"name":"Recto Verso","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/instagram.com\/corpus_corpus_expo","email":"expo.corpus.corpus@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006440"},"fr":{"name":"Recto Verso","shortdescr":"C O R P U S | C O R P U S est un voyage immersif dans l\u2019interaction entre le corps humain en tant qu\u2019objet et sujet. L\u2019expo d\u00e9voile sept r\u00e9cits puissants ancr\u00e9s dans la chair, explorant les th\u00e8mes de la r\u00e9silience, de la gu\u00e9rison, de l\u2019\u00e9mancipation et de l\u2019identit\u00e9.\n","longdescr":"C O R P U S | C O R P U S est un voyage immersif dans l\u2019interaction entre le corps humain en tant qu\u2019objet et sujet. \nLa d\u00e9marche des artistes pr\u00e9sent\u00e9s par l\u2019exposition s\u2019installe autour de la complexit\u00e9 du corps et de ses aspects tangibles et intangibles pour \u00e9lever le corps au rang de r\u00e9ceptacle d\u2019\u00e9motions, d\u2019histoires et d\u2019identit\u00e9 dans l\u2019art. \nL\u2019expo d\u00e9voile sept r\u00e9cits puissants ancr\u00e9s dans la chair, explorant les th\u00e8mes de la r\u00e9silience, de la gu\u00e9rison, de l\u2019\u00e9mancipation et de l\u2019identit\u00e9.\n","performers":"Kimbra Audrey, Seattle\/Paris (@kimbraaudrey)\nLaetitia Bica, Brussels (@laetitiabica)\nLara Chahine, Beyrouth (@ _larachahine)\nLotte Cunnell, London (@lottecunnellart)\nElisa La Gala, Brussels\/Naples (@ellegieli)\nSaid Hammouch, Brussels (@ saidohammouch)\nPhilippine Schaefer, Paris (@philippine.schaefer)\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/instagram.com\/corpus_corpus_expo","email":"expo.corpus.corpus@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006440"},"sp":{"name":"Recto Verso","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/instagram.com\/corpus_corpus_expo","email":"expo.corpus.corpus@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006440"},"nl":{"name":"Corpus Corpus","shortdescr":"C O R P U S | C O R P U S is een meeslepende expeditie naar de interactie tussen het menselijk lichaam als object en als  subject. De tentoonstelling bevat zeven krachtige verhalen die elk diep geworteld zijn in het lichaam en die thema's als zelfbevestiging, veerkracht en genezing gaan onderzoeken.","longdescr":"O R P U S | C O R P U S is een meeslepende expeditie naar de interactie tussen het menselijk lichaam als object en als  subject. De aanpak van de kunstenaars die in de tentoonstelling worden voorgesteld, draait rond de complexiteit van het lichaam  en de tactiele en spirituele aspecten om het lichaam te verheffen tot  een tempel van onze identiteit , onze verhalen en onze emoties of met andere woorden tot  kunst.  De tentoonstelling bevat zeven krachtige verhalen die elk diep geworteld zijn in het lichaam en die thema's als zelfbevestiging, veerkracht en genezing gaan onderzoeken.","performers":"Kimbra Audrey, Seattle\/Paris (@kimbraaudrey)\nLaetitia Bica, Brussels (@laetitiabica)\nLara Chahine, Beyrouth (@ _larachahine)\nLotte Cunnell, London (@lottecunnellart)\nElisa La Gala, Brussels\/Naples (@ellegieli)\nSaid Hammouch, Brussels (@ saidohammouch)\nPhilippine Schaefer, Paris (@philippine.schaefer)\n","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/instagram.com\/corpus_corpus_expo","email":"expo.corpus.corpus@gmail.com","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006440"}},"place":{"id":276866,"translations":{"de":{"name":"KULT XL Ateliers","address_street_name":"Rue Wiertz","address_street_number":"23","address_street_box":null,"email":"culture@ixelles.brussels","website":"https:\/\/culture.ixelles.be\/fr