00f3n","nl":"Tentoonstellingen"}},"others":{"list":[42,36],"translations":{"de":["Malerei","Museen & Kunstzentren"],"pt":[null,null],"en":["Painting","Museums and art centers"],"it":["Pittura","Musei e centri artistici"],"cn":[null,null],"fr":["Peinture","Mus\u00e9es et art centers"],"sp":["Pintura","Museos y centros de arte"],"nl":["Schilderkunst","Musea en kunstcentra"]}}},"translations":{"de":{"name":"Expo: James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/ensor","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555380"},"pt":{"name":"Expo: James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/ensor","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555380"},"en":{"name":"James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels","shortdescr":"Ensor and Ostend. They are inextricably linked. But did you know that Brussels played a crucial role in how Ensor developed as an artist too? ","longdescr":"In the exhibition \u201cJames Ensor. Inspired by Brussels\u201d, you will discover how the city helped to shape Ensor\u2019s quirky and characteristic visual language. From 22 February 2024, dive into the imaginary world of one of the greatest Belgian artists. Discover paintings and graphical work in a place where Ensor was often to be found during his Brussels years: the Palace of Charles of Lorraine.\n\nThis exhibition is a collaboration by KBR and the Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium and displays well-known works on canvas, as well as hidden treasures on paper.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/en\/ensor","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555380"},"it":{"name":"Expo: James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/ensor","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555380"},"cn":{"name":"Expo: James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/ensor","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555380"},"fr":{"name":"James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels","shortdescr":"Ensor et Ostende : ces deux noms sont indissociablement li\u00e9s. Mais saviez-vous que Bruxelles a \u00e9galement jou\u00e9 un r\u00f4le crucial dans le d\u00e9veloppement de l\u2019artiste ?","longdescr":"Dans l\u2019exposition \u00ab James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels \u00bb, vous d\u00e9couvrirez comment la ville a contribu\u00e9 \u00e0 fa\u00e7onner le langage imag\u00e9 idiosyncrasique et distinctif d\u2019Ensor. \u00c0 partir du 22 f\u00e9vrier 2024, plongez-vous dans le monde imaginaire de l\u2019un des plus grands artistes belges. D\u00e9couvrez des peintures et des \u0153uvres graphiques, expos\u00e9es dans un lieu o\u00f9 Ensor a souvent s\u00e9journ\u00e9 pendant ses ann\u00e9es pass\u00e9es \u00e0 Bruxelles : le palais de Charles de Lorraine.\n\nFruit d\u2019une collaboration entre KBR et les  Mus\u00e9es royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique, cette exposition pr\u00e9sente des \u0153uvres c\u00e9l\u00e8bres sur toile et des tr\u00e9sors cach\u00e9s sur papier.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/ensor","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555380"},"sp":{"name":"Expo: James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/fr\/ensor","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555380"},"nl":{"name":"James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels","shortdescr":"Ensor en Oostende. Ze zijn onlosmakelijk met elkaar verbonden. Maar wist u dat ook Brussel een cruciale rol speelde in hoe Ensor zich als kunstenaar ontwikkelde? ","longdescr":"In de tentoonstelling \u2018James Ensor. Inspired by Brussels\u2019 ontdekt u hoe de stad  Ensors eigenzinnige en kenmerkende beeldtaal mee heeft gevormd. Duik vanaf 22 februari 2024 in de imaginaire wereld van een van de grootste Belgische kunstenaars. Ontdek schilderijen en grafisch werk op een plek waar Ensor tijdens zijn Brusselse jaren vaak vertoefde: het Paleis van Karel van Lotharingen.\n\nDeze expo is een samenwerking van KBR en de Koninklijke Musea voor Schone Kunsten van Belgi\u00eb en toont bekend werk op doek en verborgen schatten op papier. ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be\/nl\/ensor","email":"info@kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.555380"}},"place":{"id":981,"translations":{"de":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Arts","address_street_number":"28","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@kbr.be","website":"http:\/\/www.kbr.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 519 53 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Mont des Arts, 28","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"KBR museum","address_street_name":"Mont des Art