\/visit.brussels\/de\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005265"},"pt":{"name":"Fredy Massamba: Album release Trancestral","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005265"},"en":{"name":"Fredy Massamba: Album release Trancestral","shortdescr":"After countless tours abroad with artists like Aka Moon or Ray Lema, Fredy Massamba will finally play at home, in Matonge, his own neighborhood, for the presentation of his album Trancestral. ","longdescr":"From his first passion for rumba in his native district of Point-Noire, in Congo-Brazzaville, to the discovery of hip-hop in the 1990s, from the co-founding of Tambours de Brazza to his collaboration with Ray Lema, the Congolese singer Fredy Massamba sketched the world with an insatiable curiosity, as if to better understand where it came from.\n\nTrancestral, third solo album, follows in the tradition of his latest adventures with Ray Lema, his mentor in musicology from the Black Continent: the same polyphonic abundance, the same rhythmic flowering, to re-enchant a vast Congolese repertoire that he never stopped exploring. Pygmy yodeling on the very beautiful track, ngoma drums, funk or hip-hop sessions\u2026 each song is like a painting, which he crosses with his soul voice, in Kikongo, the language of exquisite swing, and in Lingala, always happy to chat. One thing is certain, this concert will be a great party!","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005265"},"it":{"name":"Fredy Massamba: Album release Trancestral","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005265"},"cn":{"name":"Fredy Massamba: Album release Trancestral","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005265"},"fr":{"name":"Fredy Massamba: Album release Trancestral","shortdescr":"Apr\u00e8s d\u2019innombrables tourn\u00e9es \u00e0 l\u2019\u00e9tranger avec des artistes comme Aka Moon ou Ray Lema, Fredy Massamba jouera enfin \u00e0 domicile, \u00e0 Matonge, son propre quartier, avec la pr\u00e9sentation de son album Trancestral.","longdescr":"De ses premiers \u00e9mois de rumba dans son quartier natal de Point-Noire, au Congo-Brazzaville, \u00e0 la d\u00e9couverte du hip-hop dans les ann\u00e9es 1990, de la cofondation des Tambours de Brazza \u00e0 sa collaboration avec Ray Lema, le chanteur congolais Fredy Massamba a croqu\u00e9 le monde avec une insatiable curiosit\u00e9, comme pour mieux comprendre d\u2019o\u00f9 il venait. Trancestral, troisi\u00e8me album en solo, s\u2019inscrit dans la lign\u00e9e de ses derni\u00e8res aventures avec Ray Lema, son mentor en musicologie du continent noir: m\u00eame foisonnement polyphonique, m\u00eame floraison rythmique, pour r\u00e9enchanter un vaste repertoire congolais qu\u2019il n\u2019a jamais cess\u00e9 d\u2019explorer. Yodel pygm\u00e9e sur le tr\u00e8s beau-morceau titre, tambours ngoma, sessions de funk ou de hip-hop\u2026 chaque chanson est comme un tableau, qu\u2019il traverse de son ample voix de soul, en kikongo, langue de swing exquis, et en lingala, toujours ravi de converser. Une chose est s\u00fbre, ce concert sera une grande f\u00eate !","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005265"},"sp":{"name":"Fredy Massamba: Album release Trancestral","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005265"},"nl":{"name":"Fredy Massamba: Album release Trancestral","shortdescr":"Na talloze toernees in het buitenland met artiesten als Aka Moon of Ray Lema speelt Fredy Massamba met de voorstelling van zijn album Trancestral eindelijk nog eens een thuismatch, in zijn eigen wijk Matonge.","longdescr":"Sinds zijn eerste passie voor de rumba in zijn geboortewijk Point-Noire, in Congo-Brazzaville, over de ontdekking van hiphop in de jaren negentig of toen hij mee het legendarische les Tambours de Brazza oprichtte tot zijn samenwerking met Ray Lema, de Congolese zanger Fredy Massamba heeft de wereld steeds benaderd met een onverzadigbare nieuwsgierigheid, alsof hij beter wilde begrijpen waar die vandaan kwam. Trancestral, zijn derde soloalbum, volgt de traditie van zijn laatste avonturen met Ray Lema, zijn mentor in de musicologie van het Zwarte Continent. Met dezelfde polyfone overvloed, dezelfde ritmische rijkdom tovert hij met een enorm Congolees repertoire dat hij nooit gestopt is te verkennen. In Fredy\u2019s universum hoor je hem pygmee jodelen, ngoma-drums spelen, maar krijg je ook funk- of hiphopinvloeden. Elk nummer is als een schilderij, dat hij doorkruist met zijn rijke soulstem, in het Kikongo, met zijn swingende ritme, en in Lingala, geschikt om verhalen te vertellen. E\u00e9n ding staat vast. Dit concert wordt een gigantisch feest.","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/muziekpublique.be\/","email":"info@muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005265"}},"place":{"id":238099,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique, keeps music and dance traditions alive and kicking in Brussels through an ambitious programme of concerts, courses, and projects. A year-round concert programme, featuring Belgian and international artists, forms the core of the foundation\u2019s activities. From the contemplative to the madly festive concerts take place indoors,  in the small Moli\u00e8re Theatre, in the arcade at the Porte de Namur and outdoors, around the city and throughout the year.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"it":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"cn":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"fr":{"name":"Muziekpublique","address_street_name":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@muziekpublique.be","website":"http:\/\/www.muziekpublique.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 217 26 00","phone_booking":"+32 2 217 26 00","address_zip":"1050","address_city":"Ixelles","address_line1":"Galerie de la Porte de Namur, 3","address_line2":"1050 Ixelles","description_web":"Muziekpublique est le centre des musiques traditionnelles du monde de Bruxelles. Etablie dans le Th\u00e9\u00e2tre Moli\u00e8re au c\u0153ur du quartier africain, l\u2019asbl organise plus de 100 concerts par an et deux festivals (Hide & Seek Festival etc.). Par ailleurs Muziekpublique propose a