uid\u00e9e pour visiteurs individuels (FR)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/02\/24\/visite-guidee-pour-visiteurs-individuels-85","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005834"},"it":{"name":"IMAGINE! 100 years of international surrealism","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/02\/24\/visite-guidee-pour-visiteurs-individuels-85","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005834"},"cn":{"name":"IMAGINE! 100 years of international surrealism","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/02\/24\/visite-guidee-pour-visiteurs-individuels-85","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005834"},"fr":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e pour visiteurs individuels (FR)","shortdescr":"En compagnie d\u2019un historien ou d\u2019une historienne de l\u2019art, d\u00e9couvrez l\u2019exposition IMAGINE! 100 Years of International Surrealism, qui offre aux visiteurs une lecture \u00e9largie du surr\u00e9alisme \u00e0 travers une perspective symboliste. ","longdescr":"Les Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique inaugurent une exceptionnelle exposition itin\u00e9rante internationale con\u00e7ue en collaboration avec le Centre Pompidou (Paris).Une immersion dans la po\u00e9sie surr\u00e9aliste, \u00e0 travers les th\u00e9matiques du r\u00eave, du labyrinthe, de la m\u00e9tamorphose, de l\u2019inconnu et du subconscient, emmen\u00e9e par les grands noms du surr\u00e9alisme, de Giorgio De Chirico \u00e0 Jackson Pollock, en passant par Salvador Dal\u00ed, Joan Mir\u00f3, Meret Oppenheim, Dora Maar, Ren\u00e9 Magritte\u2026 ","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/02\/24\/visite-guidee-pour-visiteurs-individuels-85","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005834"},"sp":{"name":"IMAGINE! 100 years of international surrealism","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/02\/24\/visite-guidee-pour-visiteurs-individuels-85","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005834"},"nl":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e pour visiteurs individuels (FR)","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/fine-arts-museum.be\/fr\/agenda\/2024\/02\/24\/visite-guidee-pour-visiteurs-individuels-85","email":"reservation@fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+ 32(0)2 508 33 33","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50005834"}},"place":{"id":488,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Die Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique \u2013 6 Museen, 7 Jahrhunderte der sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnste, 20 000 Kunstwerke und Kunstgenuss vom Feinsten:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Magritte gibt es die weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dfte Sammlung von Werken des gro\u00dfen belgischen Surrealisten Ren\u00e9 Magritte zu entdecken\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle erwartet den Besucher mit K\u00fcnstlern wie Khnopff, Spilliaert, Horta, Rodin, Gauguin, Mucha und Bonnard das besondere Fin-de-Si\u00e8cle-Ambiente, das um 1900 in Br\u00fcssel herrschte. Mehr als 30 K\u00fcnstler \u2013 vom Impressionismus \u00fcber den Jugendstil, von den sch\u00f6nen K\u00fcnsten bis zur Oper.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIm Mus\u00e9e Old Master gibt es Meisterwerke aus der Epoche des 15. Jahrhunderts bis hin zum 18. Jahrhundert zu sehen, unter anderem mit der weltweit gr\u00f6\u00dften Bruegel-Sammlung, verschiedenen Werken von Rubens, van der Weyden und Jordaens. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tDas Mus\u00e9e Modern Art zeigt eine Auswahl von Meisterwerken des 20. Jahrhunderts, darunter Broodthaers, Fabre, David, Panamarenko, Alechinsky.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tDie beiden Kunstatelier-Museen Mus\u00e9e Wiertz und Meunier in Ixelles geben einen faszinierenden Einblick in die Welt dieser beiden K\u00fcnstler.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Mus\u00e9es Royaux des Beaux-Arts de Belgique","address_street_name":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@fine-arts-museum.be","website":"http:\/\/www.fine-arts-museum.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 508 32 11","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de la R\u00e9gence, 3","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Royal Museums of Fine Arts of Belgium","address_street_name":"rue de la R\u00e9gence","address_street_number":"3","address_street_box":null,"email