iment\u00e9s.\n\nArtistes\n\u200bMrzyk et Moriceau, Pol-Edouard, Fabien Karp, Gary Card, Ad\u00e8le Aproh, Elene Usdin, Michael Polakowski, Julien Colombier, Amandine Urruty, Delphine Somers, Antoine Carbonne, Davor Gromilovic, Nina Vandeweghe, Silio Durt","performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/fr\/node\/16908","email":"info@arkadia.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006570"},"sp":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e Popcorn","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/fr\/node\/16908","email":"info@arkadia.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006570"},"nl":{"name":"Visite guid\u00e9e Popcorn","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/fr\/node\/16908","email":"info@arkadia.be","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50006570"}},"place":{"id":262457,"translations":{"de":{"name":"MIMA the Millennium Iconoclast Museum of Art ","address_street_name":"quai du Hainaut","address_street_number":"39-41","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mimamuseum.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.mimamuseum.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"quai du Hainaut, 39-41","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Das neue Museum MIMA, Millenium Iconoclast Museum of Arts in Br\u00fcssel, nimmt Sie mit auf eine Entdeckungsreise in die Geschichte der Kultur 2.0! Untergebracht ist es in den bemerkenswerten Geb\u00e4ude der ehemaligen Brauerei Belle-Vue am Br\u00fcsseler Kanal.\r\n\r\nDas Millenium Iconoclast Museum of Art, das erste Museum seiner Art in Europa, l\u00e4sst die verschiedenen Etappen der zeitgen\u00f6ssischen Kunst Revue passieren und zeigt auf, welche Rolle das Internet innerhalb der Entwicklung der Kultur 2.0 spielte und spielt. Das MIMA zeigt dabei verschiedene Kunstformen, in denen die kreativen Bet\u00e4tigungsfelder nahtlos ineinander \u00fcbergehen: eine fulminante Mischung urbaner, grafischer, musikalischer, sportlicher, k\u00fcnstlerischer und Geek-Kulturen.\r\n\r\nAuf seinen 1200 m\u00b2 Ausstellungsfl\u00e4che, die sich \u00fcber vier Etagen verteilen, pr\u00e4sentiert das MIMA neben seiner st\u00e4ndigen Sammlung auch wechselnde Ausstellungen. \r\n\r\nAu\u00dferdem auf dem Programm: Vorf\u00fchrungen, Begegnungen, Konferenzen, Konzerte und Performances, ein Shop, eine Kantine und zwei Aussichtspunkte mit Blick auf den Br\u00fcsseler Kanal. Ge\u00f6ffnet mittwochs bis sonntags von 10 bis 18 Uhr, montags, dienstags und im Januar geschlossen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"MIMA, o Museu de Arte Iconoclasta Millennium","address_street_name":"Quai du Hainaut","address_street_number":"39-41","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mimamuseum.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.mimamuseum.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai du Hainaut, 39-41","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"O MIMA ocupa o extraordin\u00e1rio edif\u00edcio da antiga f\u00e1brica de cerveja Belle-Vue, situada sobre o canal no centro de Bruxelas. Um jovem museu de envergadura internacional, \u00e9 dedicado a uma cria\u00e7\u00e3o contempor\u00e2nea acess\u00edvel e viral, como Street Art. O local prop\u00f5e ao p\u00fablico exposi\u00e7\u00f5es tempor\u00e1rias, uma cole\u00e7\u00e3o permanente, encontros, proje\u00e7\u00f5es, concertos e performances, num espa\u00e7o de mais de 1200 m\u00b2 repartido em quatro andares. O MIMA tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 uma loja, uma cantina e dois miradouros para o canal de Bruxelas. Aberto durante todo o ano, de quarta-feira a domingo, das 10h \u00e0s 18h, fechado segundas e ter\u00e7as-feiras e no m\u00eas de janeiro.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"MIMA the Millennium Iconoclast Museum of Art ","address_street_name":"Quai du Hainaut","address_street_number":"39-41","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mimamuseum.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.mimamuseum.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai du Hainaut, 39-41","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"The MIMA is situated on the remarkable site of the former brewery Belle-Vue beside the canal in the center of Brussels. The MIMA is a new museum with an international vocation that advances contemporary, accessible and viral creations such as Street Art. The MIMA presents temporary exhibitions, encounters, projections, concerts, performances as well as a permanent collection. It also houses an art shop, a restaurant and two magnificent panoramic viewing points over the canal and Brussels in a magnificent building covering four different floors. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"mima","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"MIMA the Millennium Iconoclast Museum of Art ","address_street_name":"quai du Hainaut","address_street_number":"39-41","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mimamuseum.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.mimamuseum.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"quai du Hainaut, 39-41","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Fine marzo 2016 il MIMA, Millenium Iconoclast Museum of Arts, sar\u00e0 inaugurato a Bruxelles. Scoprite la storia della cultura 2.0. \r\n\r\nA seguito degli eventi drammatici di Bruxelles del 22 marzo 2016 il MIMA ha posticipato la sua apertura a nuova data. \r\n\r\nIl Millenium Iconoclast Museum of Arts, il primo museo di questo tipo in Europa, vi invita a scoprire l'evoluzione dell'arte contemporanea con l'arrivo di internet e la storia della cultura 2.0. Il MIMA illustrer\u00e0 un'arte dove le aree creative sono totalmente aperte: una miscela di culture urbane, grafiche, musicali, sportive, artistiche e geek. \r\n\r\nIl MIMA avr\u00e0 una collezione permanente e 2 esposizioni annuali saranno organizzate su una superficie di 1000  m\u00b2. \r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"MIMA the Millennium Iconoclast Museum of Art Museum","address_street_name":"Quai du Hainaut","address_street_number":"39-41","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mimamuseum.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.mimamuseum.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai du Hainaut, 39-41","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"MIMA the Millennium Iconoclast Museum of Art ","address_street_name":"Quai du Hainaut","address_street_number":"39-41","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mimamuseum.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.mimamuseum.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Quai du Hainaut, 39-41","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Le MIMA occupe le remarquable b\u00e2timent de l'ancienne brasserie Belle-Vue, situ\u00e9 le long du canal, proche du centre de Bruxelles. Jeune mus\u00e9e d'envergure internationale, il est d\u00e9di\u00e9 \u00e0 une cr\u00e9ation contemporaine accessible et virale comme le street art. Le site propose au public des expositions temporaires, une collection permanente, des rencontres, des projections, des concerts et des performances, dans un espace de plus de 1 200m\u00b2 r\u00e9partis sur quatre \u00e9tages. Le MIMA, c\u2019est aussi un shop, une cantine et deux points de vue panoramiques sur le canal de Bruxelles. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"mima","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"MIMA - Museo de Arte Iconoclasta del Milenio","address_street_name":"quai du Hainaut","address_street_number":"39-41","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mimamuseum.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.mimamuseum.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"quai du Hainaut, 39-41","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"El nuevo museo MIMA, Museo de Arte Iconoclasta del Milenio, te invita a descubrir la historia de la cultura 2.0.\r\n\r\nEl Museo de Arte Iconoclasta del Milenio es el primer museo de este g\u00e9nero en Europa. Te invita a conocer la evoluci\u00f3n del arte contempor\u00e1neo con el desembarco de internet y la historia de la cultura 2.0 en Bruselas. El MIMA expone un arte en el que los campos creativos est\u00e1n totalmente liberados: una mezcla de culturas urbanas, gr\u00e1ficas, musicales, deportivas, art\u00edsticas ygeek.\r\n\r\nEl MIMA cuenta con una colecci\u00f3n permanente y se organizan dos exposiciones anuales en un total de 1.000 m2.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"MIMA the Millennium Iconoclast Museum of Art ","address_street_name":"Henegouwenkaai","address_street_number":"39-41","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@mimamuseum.eu","website":"http:\/\/www.mimamuseum.eu","phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1080","address_city":"Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","address_line1":"Henegouwenkaai, 39-41","address_line2":"1080 Molenbeek-Saint-Jean","description_web":"Het MIMA bevindt zich in het opmerkelijke gebouw van de oude brouwerij Belle-Vue, langs het kanaal en dichtbij het centrum van Brussel. Als jong museum met internationale uitstraling is het MIMA gewijd aan toegankelijke en instagrammable hedendaagse kunst, zoals street art. Het publiek kan er terecht voor tijdelijke tentoonstellingen, een permanente collectie, ontmoetingen, filmprojecties, concerten en performances, in een ruimte van meer dan 1.200 vierkante meter verdeeld over vier verdiepingen. MIMA heeft tevens een winkel, een kantine en twee uitkijkpunten met panoramisch zicht over het Brusselse kanaal. ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":"mima","virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[8],"translations":{"de":["Kanal-Viertel"],"pt":[null],"en":["Canal"],"it":["Canal"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Canal"],"sp":["Canal"],"nl":["Kanaalwijk"]}},"zones":{"list":[23],"translations":{"de":["Westen"],"pt":[null],"en":["West"],"it":["Ovest"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Ouest"],"sp":["Oeste"],"nl":["West"]}},"neca":"art_center","facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":22457,"location":{"lat":50.85115,"lon":4.33789152},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2023-09-22T13:51:27+02:00","published_at":"2015-10-01T12:41:34+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":276946,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/en","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Since 1983, Arkadia has been exploring the richness of Belgium's and Brussels' heritage and developing numerous cultural projects especially in Brussels, between architecture, urbanism, culture, plastic arts and ideology from the Middle Ages to the present day. Seeing and understanding the city and its architectural development, approaching artistic creation and giving it meaning, these are the activities that the ASBL wants to share with the public. Specialists in architectural heritage and contemporary art, they show the city through guided tours and lectures in several languages.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Depuis 1983, Arkadia explore les richesses du patrimoine belge et bruxellois et d\u00e9veloppe de nombreux projets culturels sp\u00e9cialement \u00e0 Bruxelles, entre architecture, urbanisme, culture, arts plastiques et id\u00e9ologie depuis le Moyen \u00c2ge jusqu\u2019\u00e0 nos jours. Voir et comprendre la ville et son d\u00e9veloppement architectural, approcher la cr\u00e9ation artistique et lui donner un sens, telles sont les activit\u00e9s que l'ASBL veut partager avec le public. Sp\u00e9cialistes du patrimoine  architectural et de l'art contemporain, ils font d\u00e9couvrir la ville \u00e0 travers des visites guid\u00e9es et des conf\u00e9rences en plusieurs langues.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Rue de Namur","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Rue de Namur, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"Arkadia","address_street_name":"Naamsestraat","address_street_number":"10","address_street_box":null,"email":"info@arkadia.be","website":"https:\/\/arkadia.be\/nl","phone_contact":"+32 2 319 45 60","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Naamsestraat, 10","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":"Sinds 1983 verkent Arkadia de rijkdom van het Belgische en Brusselse erfgoed en ontwikkelt talrijke culturele projecten, vooral in Brussel, tussen architectuur, stedenbouw, cultuur, plastische kunsten en ideologie, van de Middeleeuwen tot vandaag. De stad en haar architecturale ontwikkeling zien en begrijpen, de artistieke creatie benaderen en er een betekenis aan geven, dat zijn de activiteiten die de VZW met het publiek wil delen. Zij zijn gespecialiseerd in architectonisch erfgoed en hedendaagse kunst en laten de stad zien door middel van rondleidingen en lezingen in verschillende talen.\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"region":"brussels","backoffice_id":36946,"location":{"lat":50.84145283,"lon":4.35976257},"last_updated_at":"2023-06-08T12:25:28+02:00","published_at":"2021-07-23T14:48:31+02:00","is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"resto_ranking":0},"media":[{"type":"photo","link":"https:\/\/agendabrussels2.imgix.net\/740b193ec88de7586f0dd610da91482a4e3b6b97.png","width":1174,"height":878,"ratio":1.34,"oEmbed_height":878,"oEmbed_width":1174,"translations":{"de":{"title":"Visite guid\u00e9e Popcorn","copyright":null},"pt":{"title":"Visite guid\u00e9e Popcorn","copyright":null},"en":{"title":"Visite guid\u00e9e Popcorn","copyright":null},"it":{"title":"Visite guid\u00e9e Popcorn","copyright":null},"cn":{"title":"Visite guid\u00e9e Popcorn","copyright":null},"fr":{"title":"Visite guid\u00e9e Popcorn","copyright":null},"sp":{"title":"Visite guid\u00e9e Popcorn","copyright":null},"nl":{"title":"Visite guid\u00e9e P