47 73","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000511"},"fr":{"name":"Atelier face cam\u00e9ra du mardi Playing the Character","shortdescr":"La m\u00e9thode du Studio int\u00e8gre une v\u00e9ritable dimension psychologique et organique. L\u2019acteur est son propre instrument. Il est donc primordial que l\u2019acteur explore, connaisse et affine toutes les facettes de son instrument. ","longdescr":"L'animateur Philippe Cornette a pris ses \u00e9l\u00e8ves comme acteur dans son film \"Putain d'amendement\", qui est en comp\u00e9tition au FIFE Festival International de l'Espoir, ZINEBI Bilbao, RIFF Roma Independent Film Festival, Festival Internacional De Cortometrajes Vitafest Chili, Bristol Independent Film Festival, Paris Art & Movie Awards, Warsaw International Film Festival Poland.\n\u2022\tUn travail sur la sensibilit\u00e9 et les capacit\u00e9s d\u2019expression des stagiaires.\n\u2022\tExercices de concentration.\n\u2022\tUn travail individuel et des exercices collectifs.\n\u2022\tExercices de mise en jeu: travail sur l\u2019imaginaire, l\u2019\u00e9coute, le mouvement, la respiration et diction.\nPr\u00e9coniser l\u2019utilisation de l\u2019imagination pour donner vie au texte et au personnage.\nOn travaillera :\n\u2022\tLES OUTILS PSYCHOLOGIQUES\n D\u00e9finir le type de personnalit\u00e9\nLe type de personnalit\u00e9 du personnage \n\u2013 Narcissique\n\u2013 Borderline\n\u2013 Histrionique\n\u2013 Antisocial\n\u2013 Shizo\u00efde\n\u2013 Masochiste\n\u2013 Obsessionnel-Compulsif\n\u2013 Parano\u00efaque\n\u2013 Autre trouble mental \n\u2022\tRessentir et visualiser par la m\u00e9moire affective imaginaire.\n\u2022\tLa cascade au cin\u00e9ma.\n\u2022\tLecture \u2013 \u00e9criture de sc\u00e9nario  \u2013 analyse de films.\n\u2022\tDirection d\u2019acteurs et compr\u00e9hension d\u2019image.\n\u2022\tPlusieurs tournages supervis\u00e9s.\n","performers":"Philippe Cornette (Cin\u00e9aste, acteur, auteur, metteur en sc\u00e8ne)","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.scenocity.be","email":"contact@scenocity.be","phone_contact":"+32 473 27 20 91","phone_booking":"+32 2 732 47 73","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000511"},"sp":{"name":"Atelier face cam\u00e9ra du mardi Playing the Character","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.scenocity.be","email":"contact@scenocity.be","phone_contact":"+32 473 27 20 91","phone_booking":"+32 2 732 47 73","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000511"},"nl":{"name":"Atelier face cam\u00e9ra du mardi Playing the Character","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.scenocity.be","email":"contact@scenocity.be","phone_contact":"+32 473 27 20 91","phone_booking":"+32 2 732 47 73","agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000511"}},"place":{"id":269799,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Salle paroissiale","address_street_name":"rue Jacques Hoton","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 771 63 75","phone_booking":"+32 2 771 63 75","address_zip":"1200","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","address_line1":"rue Jacques Hoton, 11","address_line2":"1200 Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"pt":{"name":"Salle paroissiale Sainte Famille","address_street_name":"rue Jacques Hoton","address_street_number":"11","address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":"+32 2 771 63 75","phone_booking":"+32 2 771 63 75","address_zip":"1200","address_city":"Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","address_line1":"rue Jacques Hoton, 11","address_line2":"1200 Woluwe-Saint-Lambert","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null},"en"