on of Concerts Escapades 2023 - 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.mpfb.org\/project.php?project=escapades&lg=FR","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/pt\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000853"},"en":{"name":"The new season of Concerts Escapades 2023 - 2024","shortdescr":"The new season of Concerts Escapades 2023 - 2024 kicks off on Sunday 24 September at 8.30pm with \"Dance! Dance! Dance!!!\" and with a \"+\", i.e. a surprise at each concert.\n-\nAs last season, we present unexpected concerts, including 'Dance', 'Contrasts', 'sex with Brahms', 'Erwin O Erwin', 'Ren\u00e9 Magritte', 'Love Baroque' and 'The Good&the Bad The Ugly&the Beauty'... \n\n\n","longdescr":"The new season of Concerts Escapades 2023 - 2024 kicks off on Sunday 24 September at 8.30pm with \"Dance! Dance!! Dance!!!\" and always with a \u201c+\": a surprise that we take great pleasure in offering the audience.\n\nAs in last season, we'll be offering a wide variety of exciting concerts. Not so much on 'classical' themes as 'Romanticism', 'Baroque', or a particular musical instrument or composer, but more thematic as for example 'Dance! Dance!! Dance!!!', 'Contrasts', 'Angels\/Demons' or \u2018Pathfinderesses' as part of the Woman Music Festival.\n\nFirst concert in September: Dance! Dance!! Dance!!! classical music to get you close to the dance floor. Sunday 24 September at 20.30 - Doors open at 19.30 for drinks and food. At the Tricoterie\n\nSecond Pathfinderesses concert in October: music written exclusively by women, from Nina Simone to Lili and Nadia Boulanger, from NEEKA and Joni Mitchell to Gubaidulina and Fonteyn. At the Musique Femmes festival on Sunday 15 October at the Salle Le Baixu in Tours et Taxis.\n\nThird concert in November: \u201cContrasts\u201d your rollercoaster emotional ride . Sunday 5 November at 20.30 at La Tricoterie\n\nFourth concert in December: we will have the honour of welcoming Mr Lubimov, internationally acclaimed pianist, who will play on the no less famous STEINWAY Number 1 piano, a reconstruction of the first Steinway piano, a tribute to the Maene workshops. Sunday 10 December at 20.30 La Tricoterie\n-\nFor 2024, the program is just as rich and exciting: \nIn January, Unexpected! We'll be exploring the \"sex\" in Brahms.  SEX With BRAHMS concerts with chairdance.\nIn February, the Ren\u00e9 Magritte concert.\nIn conclusion, it's going to be a rich season at La Tricoterie, with an excursion to the \"baixu\" room on the Tours et Taxis site.","performers":" Alexei Lubimov (pianist) - Nikolaas Kende (pianist) - Yu-Fen Chang (pianist) - Quarteto Qu\u00edron - Neeka (soul and pop singer) - vincent Hepp (viola) - Sarah Dupriez (Cello) - Isaak Duerinck (pianist) - Chiara Monteverde  - Iris Ensemble - Olivia Afendulis - Wei-lian Huang - Houcke Guilaume - Veronika Iltchenko - Olga Andryuschenko - Hello Shelly","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.mpfb.org\/project.php?project=escapades","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/en\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000853"},"it":{"name":"The new season of Concerts Escapades 2023 - 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.mpfb.org\/project.php?project=escapades&lg=FR","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/it\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000853"},"cn":{"name":"The new season of Concerts Escapades 2023 - 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.mpfb.org\/project.php?project=escapades&lg=FR","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/cn\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000853"},"fr":{"name":"The new season of Concerts Escapades 2023 - 2024","shortdescr":"La nouvelle saison Concerts Escapades 2023 - 2024 commence le dimanche 24 septembre \u00e0 20H30 avec \u201cDance ! Dance !! Dance !!!\u201d et avec toujours  un \u201c+\u201d, c'est-\u00e0-dire une surprise \u00e0 chaque concert.\nComme la saison derni\u00e8re, nous pr\u00e9sentons des concerts inattendus, \u201cDance\u201d, \u201cContrasts\u201d, \u201csex with Brams\u201d, \u201cErwin O Erwin\u201d, \"Ren\u00e9 magritte\", \"Love Baroque\", \"The Good&the Bad The Ugly&the Beauty\"... \n\n","longdescr":"La nouvelle saison Concerts Escapades 2023 - 2024 commence le dimanche 24 septembre \u00e0 20H30 avec \u201cDance ! Dance !! Dance !!!\u201d et avec toujours  un \u201c+\u201d, c'est-\u00e0-dire une surprise que nous prenons plaisir \u00e0 offrir au public.\n\nComme la saison derni\u00e8re, il y aura de la vari\u00e9t\u00e9 et on voyagera entre diff\u00e9rentes propositions de concerts accueillantes.\n\nNon sur des th\u00e8mes \u201cclassiques\u201d: comme \u2018romantisme', \u2018baroque', ou d\u2019un instrument de musique ou encore d\u2019un compositeur, mais nous partirons sur la base d\u2019un th\u00e8me comme \u201cdance\u201d, \u201ccontrasts\u201d, \u201cangels \/ demons\u201d ou encore \u201cPathfinderesses\u201d (les \u00e9claireuses) dans le cadre du Musique Femmes Festival (Tours et Taxis).\nPremier concert en septembre: Dance !, Dance !!, Dance !!!,  du classique qui vous donnera envie de vous remuer. Le dimanche 24 septembre \u00e0 20h30- Ouverture des portes 19H30 pour boire un verre ou manger. A la Tricoterie\n\nDeuxi\u00e8me concert \"les \u00e9claireuses\" (Pathfinderessesen) octobre: musique exclusivement \u00e9crite par femmes, de Nina Simone \u00e0 Lili et Nadia Boulanger, de NEEKA et Joni Mitchell a Ustvolskaya et Fonteyn. Au Musique Femmes Festival le dimanche 15 octobre \u00e0 la salle Le Baixu \u00e0 Tours et Taxis.\n\nTroisi\u00e8me concert en novembre: \u201cContrasts\u201d vos \u00e9motions feront des montagnes russes. Le dimanche 5 novembre \u00e0 20H30 \u00e0 La Tricoterie\n-\nQuatri\u00e8me concert en d\u00e9cembre: nous aurons l\u2019honneur d\u2019accueillir en exclusivit\u00e9 Monsieur Alexei Lubimov, pianiste de renomm\u00e9e internationale, qui jouera sur le non moins c\u00e9l\u00e8bre piano STEINWAY Number 1, reconstitution du premier piano Steinway, en hommage aux ateliers de Maene. Dimanche 10 d\u00e9cembre \u00e0 20h30 La Tricoterie\n-\nPour 2024, le programme est tout aussi riche et passionnant : \nEn janvier, Inattendu ! Nous explorons le \"sexe\" dans Brahms. Le Concert SEX With BRAHMS avec du ChairDance.\nEn f\u00e9vrier, le concert Ren\u00e9 Magritte.\nEn conclusion, une saison riche \u00e0 La Tricoterie, avec une excursion \u00e0 la salle \"baixu\" sur le site de Tours et Taxis.","performers":" Alexei Lubimov (pianiste) - Nikolaas Kende (pianiste) - Yu-Fen Chang (pianiste) - Quarteto Qu\u00edron - Neeka ( chanteuse soul et pop ) - Vincent Hepp (alto) - Sarah Dupriez  (Violoncelle) - Isaak Duerinck (pianiste) - Chiara Monteverde - Iris ensemble - Olivia Afendulis - Wei-lian Huang - Houcke Guilaume - Veronika Iltchenko - Olga Andryuschenko - Hello Shelly","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.mpfb.org\/project.php?project=escapades&lg=FR","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/fr\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000853"},"sp":{"name":"The new season of Concerts Escapades 2023 - 2024","shortdescr":null,"longdescr":null,"performers":null,"boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.mpfb.org\/project.php?project=escapades&lg=FR","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/sp\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000853"},"nl":{"name":"The new season of Concerts Escapades 2023 - 2024","shortdescr":"Het nieuwe seizoen van Concerts Escapades 2023 - 2024 begint op zondag 24 september om 20.30 uur met \"Dance! Dance! Dance!!!\" en met een \"+\", d.w.z. een verrassing bij elk concert.\nNet als vorig seizoen presenteren we een aantal onverwachte concerten, waaronder 'Dance', 'Contrasts', 'sex with Brams', 'Erwin O Erwin', 'Ren\u00e9 Magritte', 'Love Baroque' en 'The Good&the Bad The Ugly&the Beauty'... \n","longdescr":"Het nieuwe seizoen van Concerts Escapades 2023 - 2024 start op zondag 24 september om 20.30 uur met \"Dance! Dance!! Dance!!!\" zoals altijd met een \u201c+\u201d: een verrassing die we het publiek met plezier aanbieden.\n\nNet als vorig seizoen zal er veel afwisseling zijn en zullen we reizen tussen een waaier aan uitnodigende en verrassende concerten.\n\nWe zullen ons niet concentreren op 'klassieke' thema's zoals 'Romantiek', 'Barok' of een bepaald muziekinstrument of componist. We zullen eerder themata aansnijden zoals 'Dans', 'Contrasts', 'Angels\/Demons' of \u2018Padvinderessen\u201d (Pathfinderesses )als onderdeel van het Vrouwen Muziek Festival.\n\nEerste concert in september: Dance! Dance!! Dance!!!, klassieke muziek die je in ritmische beweging zal brengen, van het Zwanenmeer tot aan muziek die gecomponeerd is voor Sidi Larbi Cherkaoui!. Zondag 24 september om 20.30 uur - De deuren gaan om 19.30 uur open voor een hapje en een drankje. In La Tricoterie\n\nTweede \u201cpad-vindende in het vrouwelijk\u201d concert in oktober: muziek uitsluitend geschreven door vrouwen, van Nina Simone tot Lili en Nadia Boulanger, van NEEKA en Joni Mitchell tot Gubaidulina en Fonteyn. Op het Musique Femmes Festival op zondag 15 oktober in de Salle Le Baixu in Tours et Taxis.\n\nDerde concert in november: \u201cContrasts\u201d, een achtbaanrit vol emoties. Zondag 5 november om 20.30 in La Tricoterie\n\nVierde concert in december: we hebben de eer om de heer Lubimov te verwelkomen, een internationaal gerenommeerde pianist, die zal spelen op de niet minder beroemde STEINWAY Number 1 piano, een reconstructie van de eerste Steinway piano en dus een eerbetoon aan de piano's Maene Werkplaatsen. Zondag 10 december om 20.30 in La Tricoterie - \n_\nVoor 2024 is het programma net zo rijk en spannend: \nIn januari, Onverwacht! We onderzoeken \"seks\" in Brahms. SEX With BRAHMS concert met ChairDance.\nIn februari, het Ren\u00e9 Magritte concert.\nTot slot een rijk seizoen bij La Tricoterie, met een excursie naar de \"baixu\"-kamer op de site van Tours et Taxis.\n","performers":" Alexei Lubimov (pianist) - Nikolaas Kende (pianist) - Yu-Fen Chang (pianist) - Quarteto Qu\u00edron - Neeka ( soul en popzangeres ) - Vincent Hepp (altviool) - Sarah Dupriez (Cello) - Isaak Duerinck (pianist) - Chiara Monteverde - Iris Ensemble - Olivia Afendulis - Wei-lian Huang - Houcke Guilaume - Veronika Iltchenko - Olga Andryuschenko - Hello Shelly","boxoffice_url":null,"website":"https:\/\/www.mpfb.org\/project.php?project=escapades&lg=NL","email":"crit.escapade@gmail.com","phone_contact":"+32 2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"agenda_url":"https:\/\/visit.brussels\/nl\/visitors\/agenda\/event-detail.50000853"}},"place":{"id":252101,"translations":{"de":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"en":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Link factory","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie is above all a civil, cultural, sustainable and innovative project. Their cultural programme featuring performances, shows, exhibitions and so on goes hand in hand with a \u201ccivil\u201d programme of debates, conferences, inter-generational workshops, philosophical caf\u00e9 etc ... The place can be rented for events and there are plenty of really great parties! ","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"it":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"cn":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"fr":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Fabrique de liens","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie est un projet culturel fond\u00e9 en 2010 par une poign\u00e9e de citoyen\u00b7nes et situ\u00e9 dans une ancienne usine restaur\u00e9e avec des mat\u00e9riaux \u00e9cologiques. La Tricoterie propose une programmation culturelle tr\u00e8s diversifi\u00e9e et centr\u00e9e sur la rencontre entre les diff\u00e9rents publics et le m\u00e9lange des activit\u00e9s culturelles.\r\n\r\nPassez la porte et d\u00e9couvrez :\r\n- Des spectacles de th\u00e9\u00e2tre, de danse, de cirque...\r\n- Des concerts, des soir\u00e9es, des sc\u00e8nes ouvertes, des jam sessions, une chorale d'un soir...\r\n- Des ateliers z\u00e9ro d\u00e9chet, peinture, c\u00e9ramique, \u0153nologie, danse...\r\n- Des projections de films, conf\u00e9rences, d\u00e9bats...\r\n- Des couscous \"s\u00e9pharabes\", des soir\u00e9es jeux de soci\u00e9t\u00e9, des activit\u00e9s pour enfants...\r\n- Des march\u00e9s des cr\u00e9ateur\u00b7rices, des vide-dressings, des march\u00e9s de No\u00ebl durables...\r\n\r\nUn petit creux ? La Triciterie vous propose un brunch tous les dimanches et un concept \"live cooking\" tous les vendredis soirs. Tous les plats sont 100% artisanaux, et pr\u00e9par\u00e9s sur place par l'\u00e9quipe avec des ingr\u00e9dients bio, locaux et de saison.\r\n\r\nEnvie d'organiser votre \u00e9v\u00e9nement chez vous ? La Tricoterie met ses salles \u00e0 disposition pour tout type d'\u00e9v\u00e9nement priv\u00e9 ou professionnel et propose \u00e9galement un service traiteur, que ce soit dans ses murs ou \u00e0 l'ext\u00e9rieur. Rendez-vous sur www.tricoterie.be pour en savoir plus !\r\n","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"sp":{"name":"La Tricoterie","address_street_name":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Rue Th\u00e9odore Verhaegen, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"nl":{"name":"La Tricoterie - Contactenfabriek","address_street_name":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat","address_street_number":"158","address_street_box":null,"email":"charlotte@tricoterie.be","website":"http:\/\/www.tricoterie.be","phone_contact":"+ 32 (0)2 537 96 69","phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1060","address_city":"Saint-Gilles","address_line1":"Th\u00e9odore Verhaegenstraat, 158","address_line2":"1060 Saint-Gilles","description_web":"La Tricoterie is een project met een welomlijnde filosofie, die blijkt uit de zelfgekozen naam (van tricoter, breien) waarmee verwijst wordt naar het smeden van banden om de strijd tegen de ontrafeling van het sociale weefsel aan te gaan. Opgezet als een \u00abContacten Fabriek\u00bb en een ontmoetingsplaats waar verschillende disciplines en publieken elkaar ontmoeten. Naast een culturele programmering (concerten, voorstellingen, expos\u2026) en socioculturele activiteiten die sociale cohesie beogen (debatten, conferenties, intergenerationele ateliers, caf\u00e9-filo\u2026) staan de ruimtes ook open voor verhuur aan externe organisaties en bedrijven. Tal van superleuke feestjes vinden er plaats, alsook een wekelijkse biomarkt, een repaircaf\u00e9 en een alternatieve geschenkenmarkt om maar enkele van de activiteiten te noemen die de duurzame levensvisie van de plek weerspiegelen.","description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null}},"districts":{"list":[7],"translations":{"de":["Saint-Gilles Zentrum"],"pt":[null],"en":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"it":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"sp":["Saint-Gilles Centre"],"nl":["Sint-Gillis centrum"]}},"zones":{"list":[21],"translations":{"de":["S\u00fcden"],"pt":[null],"en":["South"],"it":["Sud"],"cn":[null],"fr":["Sud"],"sp":["Sur"],"nl":["Zuid"]}},"neca":null,"facebook_id":null,"backoffice_id":14176,"location":{"lat":50.83028735,"lon":4.33675871},"region":"brussels","last_updated_at":"2024-01-25T14:21:07+01:00","published_at":"2013-10-19T01:47:56+02:00","import_origin":null,"external_id":null,"is_in_address_book":true,"is_in_vb_export":true,"resto_ranking":0},"organizer":{"id":276119,"translations":{"de":{"name":"Music Projects for Brussels ","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Music Projects for Brussels ","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"sort_order":null,"virtual_visit":null,"visit_url":null},"pt":{"name":"Music Projects for Brussels ","address_street_name":null,"address_street_number":null,"address_street_box":null,"email":null,"website":null,"phone_contact":null,"phone_booking":null,"address_zip":"1000","address_city":"Bruxelles","address_line1":"Music Projects for Brussels ","address_line2":"1000 Bruxelles","description_web":null,"description_print":null,"booking_url":null,"